{"project":{"indexOriginal":0,"gameEngine":"APPUI","files":{"/addons/VNTextPatch/vntextpatch.js":{"data":[["I have extracted the game data","게임 데이터를 추출했습니다"],["Load game's data folder","게임의 데이터 폴더 불러오기"],["Select the game's data folder","게임의 데이터 폴더 선택"],["Engine Info","엔진 정보"],["Currently detected engine","현재 감지된 엔진"],["Manually Specify Format","형식 수동 지정"],["Manually specify the game format.<br />VNTranslationTools will automatically detect the format based on the file extension. However, if you encounter ambiguous file extensions, please provide the format explicitly.","게임 형식을 수동으로 지정합니다.<br />VNTranslationTools는 파일 확장자를 기반으로 형식을 자동으로 감지합니다. 그러나 모호한 파일 확장자가 있을 경우 형식을 명시적으로 제공해 주세요."],["Interface","인터페이스"],["VNTextPatch can parse the game into two formats: JSON or an XLSX spreadsheet. Please select the interface you want to use.","VNTextPatch는 게임을 JSON 또는 XLSX 스프레드시트 두 형식으로 파싱할 수 있습니다. 사용할 인터페이스를 선택해 주세요."],["Warning: There is a row limit if you're choosing XLSX spreadsheet.","경고: XLSX 스프레드시트를 선택할 경우 행 제한이 있습니다."],["Create a new project","새 프로젝트 만들기"],["Invalid destination directory:","잘못된 대상 디렉토리:"],["Close","닫기"]],"context":[["tid/8164/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8228/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8233/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8246/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8251/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8256/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8261/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8266/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8271/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8276/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8455/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8516/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/11110/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"vntextpatch.js","dirname":"/addons/VNTextPatch","extension":".js","filename":"vntextpatch.js","path":"/addons/VNTextPatch/vntextpatch.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"I have extracted the game data":0,"Load game's data folder":1,"Select the game's data folder":2,"Engine Info":3,"Currently detected engine":4,"Manually Specify Format":5,"Manually specify the game format.<br />VNTranslationTools will automatically detect the format based on the file extension. However, if you encounter ambiguous file extensions, please provide the format explicitly.":6,"Interface":7,"VNTextPatch can parse the game into two formats: JSON or an XLSX spreadsheet. Please select the interface you want to use.":8,"Warning: There is a row limit if you're choosing XLSX spreadsheet.":9,"Create a new project":10,"Invalid destination directory:":11,"Close":12},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/actionEditorParser/ae4parser.js":{"data":[["Start translation from Action Editor 4 Game","Action Editor 4 Game에서 번역 시작"],["Create Project","프로젝트 생성"]],"context":[["tid/920/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/997/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"ae4parser.js","dirname":"/addons/actionEditorParser","extension":".js","filename":"ae4parser.js","path":"/addons/actionEditorParser/ae4parser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Start translation from Action Editor 4 Game":0,"Create Project":1},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/adminTools/!post.html":{"data":[["Actions","작업"],["Build for 32bit system","32비트 시스템용 빌드"],["Build for non developer build too","비개발자 빌드용도 빌드"],["Custom Version","사용자 정의 버전"],["Custom version (leave blank to autogenerate version)","사용자 정의 버전 (비워두면 자동 생성됨)"],["Generate minor versioning?","마이너 버전 생성?"],["Save patch to","패치 저장 위치"],["Destination folder of generated patch","생성된 패치의 대상 폴더"],["Overider template","오버라이더 템플릿"],["Release template","릴리스 템플릿"],["Select file to be available live and excluded from the package","패키지에서 제외되지만 온라인에서 사용 가능한 파일 선택"],["The file will be excluded from package, but available online","파일은 패키지에서 제외되지만 온라인에서 사용 가능합니다"],["Make the process does not require user input","사용자 입력 없이 프로세스 실행"],["Patch Type","패치 유형"],["The file will be excluded from package, but available online. Select the file you want to substitute.","파일은 패키지에서 제외되지만 온라인에서 사용 가능합니다. 대체할 파일을 선택하세요."],["Substitute trans.js with a fake one.","trans.js를 가짜 파일로 대체합니다."],["Select Patch File","패치 파일 선택"],["Select the generated patch file (*.tpch).","생성된 패치 파일(*.tpch)을 선택하세요."],["Patches Links","패치 링크"],["Autoupdate will download from these links. <b>Must be direct download!</b> Separate each download link with newline.","자동 업데이트가 이 링크에서 다운로드합니다. <b>직접 다운로드 링크여야 합니다!</b> 각 다운로드 링크를 줄바꿈으로 구분하세요."],["Download Links","다운로드 링크"],["Downloadable package for manual download. Separate each download link with newline.","수동 다운로드용 다운로드 가능한 패키지. 각 다운로드 링크를 줄바꿈으로 구분하세요."],["Release Category","릴리스 카테고리"],["Category of the release.","릴리스의 카테고리입니다."],["Upload log along with this submission.","이 제출과 함께 로그 업로드"],["Remove the same version found on database.","데이터베이스에서 발견된 동일한 버전을 제거합니다."],["Whether this release is enabled or not.","이 릴리스가 활성화되었는지 여부입니다."],["Whether this release is hidden or not. If a release is hidden. Only Administrators and member with <code>view_hidden_releases</code> (Developer) capability can install the release via package installer.","이 릴리스가 숨겨졌는지 여부입니다. 릴리스가 숨겨진 경우, 관리자와 <code>view_hidden_releases</code> (개발자) 권한을 가진 구성원만 패키지 설치자를 통해 릴리스를 설치할 수 있습니다."],["Release Name","릴리스 이름"],["Release Number","릴리스 번호"],["Release Date","릴리스 날짜"],["Release Key","릴리스 키"],["Release Type","릴리스 유형"],["CRC","CRC"],["Required Version","필요 버전"],["Minimum Version","최소 버전"],["Release Note","릴리스 노트"],["Release Info","릴리스 정보"],["On Before Install","설치 전"],["On After Install","설치 후"],["Extra parameters","추가 매개변수"],["Remote file","원격 파일"],["List of remote file, separate by new line","원격 파일 목록, 새 줄로 구분"],["Patron Level","후원자 등급"],["Post title","게시물 제목"],["Release post","릴리스 게시물"],["Excerpt of the post","게시물 발췌"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText","idx/14/innerText","idx/29/innerText","idx/79/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/3/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText","idx/16/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText","idx/17/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText","idx/18/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText","idx/19/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText","idx/20/innerText"],["idx/9/innerText","idx/21/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText","idx/22/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText","idx/25/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText","idx/28/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/35/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/38/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/41/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/45/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"],["idx/49/innerText"],["idx/51/innerText"],["idx/53/innerText"],["idx/55/innerText"],["idx/57/innerText"],["idx/59/innerText"],["idx/61/innerText"],["idx/63/innerText"],["idx/65/innerText"],["idx/67/innerText"],["idx/69/innerText"],["idx/70/innerText"],["idx/71/innerText"],["idx/73/innerText"],["idx/75/innerText"],["idx/77/innerText"]],"basename":"!post.html","dirname":"/addons/adminTools","extension":".html","filename":"!post.html","path":"/addons/adminTools/!post.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Actions":0,"":1,"Build for 32bit system":1,"Build for non developer build too":2,"Custom Version":3,"Custom version (leave blank to autogenerate version)":4,"Generate minor versioning?":5,"Save patch to":6,"Destination folder of generated patch":7,"Overider template":8,"Release template":9,"Select file to be available live and excluded from the package":10,"The file will be excluded from package, but available online":11,"Make the process does not require user input":12,"Patch Type":13,"The file will be excluded from package, but available online. Select the file you want to substitute.":14,"Substitute trans.js with a fake one.":15,"Select Patch File":16,"Select the generated patch file (*.tpch).":17,"Patches Links":18,"Autoupdate will download from these links. <b>Must be direct download!</b> Separate each download link with newline.":19,"Download Links":20,"Downloadable package for manual download. Separate each download link with newline.":21,"Release Category":22,"Category of the release.":23,"Upload log along with this submission.":24,"Remove the same version found on database.":25,"Whether this release is enabled or not.":26,"Whether this release is hidden or not. If a release is hidden. Only Administrators and member with <code>view_hidden_releases</code> (Developer) capability can install the release via package installer.":27,"Release Name":28,"Release Number":29,"Release Date":30,"Release Key":31,"Release Type":32,"CRC":33,"Required Version":34,"Minimum Version":35,"Release Note":36,"Release Info":37,"On Before Install":38,"On After Install":39,"Extra parameters":40,"Remote file":41,"List of remote file, separate by new line":42,"Patron Level":43,"Post title":44,"Release post":45,"Excerpt of the post":46},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/adminTools/!postPackage.html":{"data":[["Select package json file","패키지 json 파일 선택"],["Select the generated patch file","생성된 패치 파일 선택"],["Or Select Destination File","또는 대상 파일 선택"],["Or Download location","또는 다운로드 위치"],["Icon","아이콘"],["Author","작성자"],["Name","이름"],["name of the package.","패키지의 이름입니다."],["Title","제목"],["Title of the package.","패키지의 제목입니다."],["Version","버전"],["Version of the package.","패키지의 버전입니다."],["Description","설명"],["Description of the package.","패키지의 설명입니다."],["Whether this release is active or not.","이 릴리스가 활성 상태인지 여부입니다."],["Whether this release is hidden or not.","이 릴리스가 숨겨져 있는지 여부입니다."],["Patron Level","후원자 등급"],["Current month's pledge in $","현재 월의 후원 금액($)"],["Patron Points","후원 포인트"],["100pts = 1$","100포인트 = 1달러"],["Purchase type","구매 유형"],["Type of the purchase.","구매의 유형입니다."],["On Before Install","설치 전"],["Javascript code to be run before install","설치 전에 실행될 자바스크립트 코드"],["On After Install","설치 후"],["Javascript code to be run after install","설치 후에 실행될 자바스크립트 코드"],["Manifest","매니페스트"],["Manifest data","매니페스트 데이터"],["Minimum version","최소 버전"],["Minimum version of Translator++ to be able to insatall this addon.","이 애드온을 설치할 수 있는 Translator++의 최소 버전입니다."],["Release Date","출시 날짜"],["Is parser changed?","파서가 변경되었나요?"],["Mark as parser change. Would warn the user to backup their project before updating to this addon.","파서 변경으로 표시합니다. 이 애드온으로 업데이트하기 전에 사용자에게 프로젝트를 백업하도록 경고합니다."],["Remove the same version found on database.","데이터베이스에서 발견된 동일한 버전을 제거합니다."],["Excluded files","제외된 파일"],["Files listed here will be excluded from the distribution packages","여기에 나열된 파일은 배포 패키지에서 제외됩니다."],["Script URL","스크립트 URL"],["Script of the URL.","URL의 스크립트입니다."],["Upload script","스크립트 업로드"],["This script will be uploaded to the back-end and will be processed with [php]Scripts template script.\n\t\t\t\t\tTo use this feature:\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Create a wordpress page with <b>[php]Scripts template</b> template.<br>You can also set the patreon's requirement to view the post.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Add the url to the page into the package.json file with <b>l</b> GET parameter point to the local file.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFor example : <u>https://dreamsavior.net/script/translation-proxy/?l=/sub.js</u>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t","이 스크립트는 백엔드에 업로드되어 [php]Scripts 템플릿 스크립트로 처리됩니다.\n\t\t\t\t\t이 기능을 사용하려면:\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><b>[php]Scripts 템플릿</b> 템플릿으로 워드프레스 페이지를 생성하세요.<br>포스트를 보기 위한 패트리온 요구사항도 설정할 수 있습니다.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>package.json 파일에 <b>l</b> GET 매개변수가 로컬 파일을 가리키도록 페이지 URL을 추가하세요.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t예: <u>https://dreamsavior.net/script/translation-proxy/?l=/sub.js</u>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t"],["Actions","작업"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText","idx/3/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/16/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/24/innerText"],["idx/25/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/28/innerText"],["idx/29/innerText"],["idx/30/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/38/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/41/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/44/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"]],"basename":"!postPackage.html","dirname":"/addons/adminTools","extension":".html","filename":"!postPackage.html","path":"/addons/adminTools/!postPackage.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Select package json file":0,"Select the generated patch file":1,"Or Select Destination File":2,"Or Download location":3,"":4,"Icon":4,"Author":5,"Name":6,"name of the package.":7,"Title":8,"Title of the package.":9,"Version":10,"Version of the package.":11,"Description":12,"Description of the package.":13,"Whether this release is active or not.":14,"Whether this release is hidden or not.":15,"Patron Level":16,"Current month's pledge in $":17,"Patron Points":18,"100pts = 1$":19,"Purchase type":20,"Type of the purchase.":21,"On Before Install":22,"Javascript code to be run before install":23,"On After Install":24,"Javascript code to be run after install":25,"Manifest":26,"Manifest data":27,"Minimum version":28,"Minimum version of Translator++ to be able to insatall this addon.":29,"Release Date":30,"Is parser changed?":31,"Mark as parser change. Would warn the user to backup their project before updating to this addon.":32,"Remove the same version found on database.":33,"Excluded files":34,"Files listed here will be excluded from the distribution packages":35,"Script URL":36,"Script of the URL.":37,"Upload script":38,"This script will be uploaded to the back-end and will be processed with [php]Scripts template script.\n\t\t\t\t\tTo use this feature:\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Create a wordpress page with <b>[php]Scripts template</b> template.<br>You can also set the patreon's requirement to view the post.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Add the url to the page into the package.json file with <b>l</b> GET parameter point to the local file.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFor example : <u>https://dreamsavior.net/script/translation-proxy/?l=/sub.js</u>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t":39,"Actions":40},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/adminTools/adminTools.js":{"data":[["Close","닫기"]],"context":[["tid/588/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"adminTools.js","dirname":"/addons/adminTools","extension":".js","filename":"adminTools.js","path":"/addons/adminTools/adminTools.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Close":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/aec/aec.js":{"data":[["Universal Archive Unpacker","범용 아카이브 언패커"]],"context":[["tid/1001/type/StringLiteral","tid/1239/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"aec.js","dirname":"/addons/aec","extension":".js","filename":"aec.js","path":"/addons/aec/aec.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Universal Archive Unpacker":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-proxy.js":{"data":[["Extract a Bakin game dictionary from data.rbpack, translate dic.txt, and patch the player automatically.","data.rbpack에서 Bakin 게임 사전을 추출하고, dic.txt를 번역하며, 플레이어를 자동으로 패치합니다."],["Create project","프로젝트 생성"],["Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!","오류: customField가 정의되지 않았습니다. 이는 발생해서는 안 됩니다!"],["Please select the Bakin game executable.","Bakin 게임 실행 파일을 선택해 주세요."],["<h2>Proxy workflow</h2>","<h2>프록시 워크플로우</h2>"],["Translator++ unpacks data.rbpack into a temporary folder.","Translator++는 data.rbpack을 임시 폴더로 언패킹합니다."],["Split Dictionary uses dump-split and creates one .txt file per source area by default.","분할 사전은 기본적으로 dump-split을 사용하여 소스 영역당 하나의 .txt 파일을 생성합니다."],["Merge Dictionary uses a single dic.txt.","병합 사전은 단일 dic.txt를 사용합니다."],["Injection merges split dictionaries back into data/dic.txt and patches the player executable.","인젝션은 분할된 사전을 다시 data/dic.txt로 병합하고 플레이어 실행 파일을 패치합니다."],["Split Dictionary (default)","분할 사전 (기본)"],["Merge Dictionary","병합 사전"]],"context":[["tid/2860/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2929/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2966/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3002/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3253/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3266/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3277/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3288/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3299/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3383/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3393/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"bakin-proxy.js","dirname":"/addons/bakinParser","extension":".js","filename":"bakin-proxy.js","path":"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-proxy.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Extract a Bakin game dictionary from data.rbpack, translate dic.txt, and patch the player automatically.":0,"Create project":1,"Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!":2,"Please select the Bakin game executable.":3,"<h2>Proxy workflow</h2>":4,"Translator++ unpacks data.rbpack into a temporary folder.":5,"Split Dictionary uses dump-split and creates one .txt file per source area by default.":6,"Merge Dictionary uses a single dic.txt.":7,"Injection merges split dictionaries back into data/dic.txt and patches the player executable.":8,"Split Dictionary (default)":9,"Merge Dictionary":10},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-xlsx.js":{"data":[["Start a translation project from RPG Developer Bakin localization sheet (xlsx).","RPG Developer Bakin 현지화 시트(xlsx)에서 번역 프로젝트를 시작합니다."],["Create project","프로젝트 생성"],["Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!","오류: customField가 정의되지 않았습니다. 이는 발생해서는 안 됩니다!"],["Please select the entry point to translate.","번역할 진입점을 선택해 주세요."],["<h2>RPG Developer Bakin editor is required</h2>","<h2>RPG Developer Bakin 편집기가 필요합니다</h2>"],["RPG Developer Bakin editor is required to start the translation project.","번역 프로젝트를 시작하려면 RPG Developer Bakin 편집기가 필요합니다."],["<h2>Before you start</h2>","<h2>시작하기 전에</h2>"],["<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.bakinParser.openDecompileForm()\">Unpack your game</a> into editable RPG Developer Bakin's project.","<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.bakinParser.openDecompileForm()\">게임을 언팩</a>하여 편집 가능한 RPG Developer Bakin 프로젝트로 변환하세요."],["Export the localization strings by using RPG Developer Bakin application into a xlsx file. <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/rpg-developer-bakin/how-to-translate-rpg-developer-bakin/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"true\">See the guide here on how to translate Bakin game</a>.","RPG Developer Bakin 애플리케이션을 사용하여 현지화 문자열을 xlsx 파일로 내보내세요. <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/rpg-developer-bakin/how-to-translate-rpg-developer-bakin/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"true\">Bakin 게임 번역 방법 가이드 보기</a>."]],"context":[["tid/614/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/683/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/720/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/756/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1034/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1041/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1064/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1077/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1088/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"bakin-xlsx.js","dirname":"/addons/bakinParser","extension":".js","filename":"bakin-xlsx.js","path":"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-xlsx.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Start a translation project from RPG Developer Bakin localization sheet (xlsx).":0,"Create project":1,"Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!":2,"Please select the entry point to translate.":3,"<h2>RPG Developer Bakin editor is required</h2>":4,"RPG Developer Bakin editor is required to start the translation project.":5,"<h2>Before you start</h2>":6,"<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.bakinParser.openDecompileForm()\">Unpack your game</a> into editable RPG Developer Bakin's project.":7,"Export the localization strings by using RPG Developer Bakin application into a xlsx file. <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/rpg-developer-bakin/how-to-translate-rpg-developer-bakin/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"true\">See the guide here on how to translate Bakin game</a>.":8},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/basicUtils.js":{"data":[["NWJS Version","NWJS 버전"],["Change into this NWJS version","이 NWJS 버전으로 변경"],["Use Developer version","개발자 버전 사용"],["Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.","NWJS 개발자 버전을 사용하세요. 개발자 버전에는 개발자 도구가 포함되어 있어 디버깅 및 개발에 적합합니다."],["In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.","개발자 버전에서는 <b>개발자 콘솔</b>을 사용할 수 있습니다. 개발자 콘솔은 F12를 누르거나 앱을 우클릭하여 '검사'를 선택하여 접근할 수 있습니다."],["Use 32-bit version","32비트 버전 사용"],["Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).","NWJS의 32비트 버전을 사용하세요. 32비트 버전은 오래된 시스템과의 호환성에 유용합니다. 가능하면 이 옵션을 선택 해제하는 것이 좋습니다(그냥 컴퓨터를 업그레이드하세요, 친구)."],["Some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version","일부 Translator++ 기능은 NWJS 버전 간에 작동하지 않을 수 있습니다"],["Please be aware that some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version. Make sure to test your project after changing the NWJS version.","일부 Translator++ 기능이 NWJS 버전 간에 작동하지 않을 수 있음을 유의하세요. NWJS 버전을 변경한 후 프로젝트를 테스트하세요."],["You're currently running on NWJS ver.","현재 NWJS 버전을 실행 중입니다."],["Change Translator++ Core NWJS version","Translator++ 코어 NWJS 버전 변경"],["You're already using the selected NWJS version.","이미 선택한 NWJS 버전을 사용 중입니다."],["This operation will close Translator++ and change the current NW.js version into","이 작업은 Translator++를 닫고 현재 NW.js 버전을 다음으로 변경합니다."],["If you have any unsaved changes, please select 'Cancel' and save your project first.\nDo you want to continue?","저장되지 않은 변경 사항이 있다면 '취소'를 선택하고 프로젝트를 먼저 저장하세요.\n계속하시겠습니까?"]],"context":[["tid/1342/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1352/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1428/type/StringLiteral","tid/1617/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1438/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1449/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1482/type/StringLiteral","tid/1641/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1492/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1532/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1537/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1669/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1745/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1769/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1782/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"basicUtils.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils","extension":".js","filename":"basicUtils.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/basicUtils.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"NWJS Version":0,"Change into this NWJS version":1,"Use Developer version":2,"Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.":3,"In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.":4,"Use 32-bit version":5,"Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).":6,"Some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version":7,"Please be aware that some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version. Make sure to test your project after changing the NWJS version.":8,"You're currently running on NWJS ver.":9,"Change Translator++ Core NWJS version":10,"You're already using the selected NWJS version.":11,"This operation will close Translator++ and change the current NW.js version into":12,"If you have any unsaved changes, please select 'Cancel' and save your project first.\nDo you want to continue?":13},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/mainMenu.js":{"data":[["Change Language","언어 변경"],["No MTL available for this language pair","이 언어 쌍에 사용 가능한 MTL이 없습니다"],["Change default MTL for this project","이 프로젝트의 기본 MTL 변경"],["???","???"],["Search in a folder","폴더 내 검색"],["Search in Staging Files","스테이징 파일에서 검색"],["Search in Original Files","원본 파일에서 검색"],["No original files path is set for this project.","이 프로젝트에 원본 파일 경로가 설정되지 않았습니다."],["Search in Translated Files","번역 파일에서 검색"],["No translated files path is set for this project.\nYou need to inject your translation once to set the translated files path.","이 프로젝트에 번역 파일 경로가 설정되지 않았습니다.\n번역 파일 경로를 설정하려면 번역을 한 번 주입해야 합니다."],["Chat with AI Assistant","AI 어시스턴트와 채팅"],["AI Assistant is not available since the new features are not loaded.\nPlease reinstall or re-update Translator++.","새 기능이 로드되지 않아 AI 어시스턴트를 사용할 수 없습니다.\nTranslator++를 재설치하거나 재업데이트하세요."]],"context":[["tid/442/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/729/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/974/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1182/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1339/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1404/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1501/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1539/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1624/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1662/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1777/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1812/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"mainMenu.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils","extension":".js","filename":"mainMenu.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/mainMenu.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Change Language":0,"No MTL available for this language pair":1,"Change default MTL for this project":2,"???":3,"Search in a folder":4,"Search in Staging Files":5,"Search in Original Files":6,"No original files path is set for this project.":7,"Search in Translated Files":8,"No translated files path is set for this project.\nYou need to inject your translation once to set the translated files path.":9,"Chat with AI Assistant":10,"AI Assistant is not available since the new features are not loaded.\nPlease reinstall or re-update Translator++.":11},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/HTMLPacker.js":{"data":[["Path is not a file:","경로가 파일이 아닙니다:"],["Icon path is not a file:","아이콘 경로가 파일이 아닙니다:"],["Path is not an exe file:","경로가 exe 파일이 아닙니다:"],["Icon path is not an ico file:","아이콘 경로가 ico 파일이 아닙니다:"],["Html entry point","HTML 진입점"],["Select the html entry point file (usually index.html)","HTML 진입점 파일 선택 (보통 index.html)"],["Destination folder","대상 폴더"],["Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.","대상 폴더를 선택하세요. 기존 파일이 대체됩니다."],["NWJS version","NWJS 버전"],["Optional. Select NWJS version and architecture.<br />Latest version not always better, just use what works for you.","선택 사항. NWJS 버전과 아키텍처를 선택하세요.<br />최신 버전이 항상 좋은 것은 아니며, 본인에게 맞는 것을 사용하세요."],["Application ID","애플리케이션 ID"],["Set the application ID for the game. The ID must be in lowercase and can only contain letters, numbers, and underscores.","게임의 애플리케이션 ID를 설정하세요. ID는 소문자여야 하며, 문자, 숫자, 밑줄만 포함할 수 있습니다."],["Application description","애플리케이션 설명"],["Set the application description for the game.","게임의 애플리케이션 설명을 설정하세요."],["Window title","창 제목"],["Set the default window title for the game.<br />This value may be overridden by the game engine.","게임의 기본 창 제목을 설정하세요.<br />이 값은 게임 엔진에 의해 재정의될 수 있습니다."],["Window width","창 너비"],["Set the default window width for the game.","게임의 기본 창 너비를 설정하세요."],["Window height","창 높이"],["Set the default window height for the game.","게임의 기본 창 높이를 설정하세요."],["Full screen","전체 화면"],["Set the game to start in full screen mode.","게임을 전체 화면 모드로 시작하도록 설정하세요."],["Resizable","크기 조정 가능"],["Set the game window to be resizable.","게임 창을 크기 조정 가능하도록 설정하세요."],["Game icon","게임 아이콘"],["Select the icon file for the game executable. The icon file must be in .ico format. The icon will be embedded in the game executable.","게임 실행 파일의 아이콘 파일을 선택하세요. 아이콘 파일은 .ico 형식이어야 합니다. 아이콘은 게임 실행 파일에 내장됩니다."],["Through this form, you can create a playable package of your game. <br />The process will replace the existing files in the destination folder.","이 양식을 통해 게임의 실행 가능한 패키지를 생성할 수 있습니다. <br />이 과정은 대상 폴더의 기존 파일을 대체합니다."],["Start the application in full screen mode","애플리케이션을 전체 화면 모드로 시작"],["Allow the application to be resizable","애플리케이션을 크기 조정 가능하도록 허용"],["HTML Compiler","HTML 컴파일러"],["Compile","컴파일"],["Source path can not empty","소스 경로는 비워둘 수 없습니다"],["Destination path can not empty","목적지 경로는 비워둘 수 없습니다"]],"context":[["tid/86/type/StringLiteral","tid/4136/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/116/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/151/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/186/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2424/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2434/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2474/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2484/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2524/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2534/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2587/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2597/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2631/type/StringLiteral","tid/3795/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2641/type/StringLiteral","tid/3805/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2675/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2722/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2732/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2766/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2776/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2810/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2820/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2854/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2864/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2899/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2909/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2950/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3900/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3924/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4020/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4037/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4083/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4104/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"HTMLPacker.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"HTMLPacker.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/HTMLPacker.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Path is not a file:":0,"Icon path is not a file:":1,"Path is not an exe file:":2,"Icon path is not an ico file:":3,"Html entry point":4,"Select the html entry point file (usually index.html)":5,"Destination folder":6,"Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.":7,"NWJS version":8,"Optional. Select NWJS version and architecture.<br />Latest version not always better, just use what works for you.":9,"Application ID":10,"Set the application ID for the game. The ID must be in lowercase and can only contain letters, numbers, and underscores.":11,"Application description":12,"Set the application description for the game.":13,"Window title":14,"Set the default window title for the game.<br />This value may be overridden by the game engine.":15,"Window width":16,"Set the default window width for the game.":17,"Window height":18,"Set the default window height for the game.":19,"Full screen":20,"Set the game to start in full screen mode.":21,"Resizable":22,"Set the game window to be resizable.":23,"Game icon":24,"Select the icon file for the game executable. The icon file must be in .ico format. The icon will be embedded in the game executable.":25,"Through this form, you can create a playable package of your game. <br />The process will replace the existing files in the destination folder.":26,"Start the application in full screen mode":27,"Allow the application to be resizable":28,"HTML Compiler":29,"Compile":30,"Source path can not empty":31,"Destination path can not empty":32},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/Updater.js":{"data":[["An update is being installed. Please do not close the application until the installation is completed.","업데이트가 설치 중입니다. 설치가 완료될 때까지 애플리케이션을 닫지 마세요."],["Package Path","패키지 경로"],["Select the package file.","패키지 파일을 선택하세요."],["Package Key","패키지 키"],["If you have the key, please enter it here. If not, leave it empty.","키가 있으면 여기에 입력하세요. 없으면 비워두세요."],["Through this form, you can update Translator++ with the updater package file. You can download the updater package <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/translator-plusplus/translator-update-package/\" external>here</a>.","이 양식을 통해 업데이터 패키지 파일로 Translator++를 업데이트할 수 있습니다. 업데이터 패키지는 <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/translator-plusplus/translator-update-package/\" external>여기</a>에서 다운로드할 수 있습니다."],["Update from package","패키지에서 업데이트"],["Update","업데이트"],["Update Translator++","Translator++ 업데이트"]],"context":[["tid/4918/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6562/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6572/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6612/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6622/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6661/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/6753/type/StringLiteral","tid/7195/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6770/type/StringLiteral","tid/7091/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7120/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"Updater.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"Updater.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/Updater.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"An update is being installed. Please do not close the application until the installation is completed.":0,"Package Path":1,"Select the package file.":2,"Package Key":3,"If you have the key, please enter it here. If not, leave it empty.":4,"Through this form, you can update Translator++ with the updater package file. You can download the updater package <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/translator-plusplus/translator-update-package/\" external>here</a>.":5,"Update from package":6,"Update":7,"Update Translator++":8},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/info.js":{"data":[["You have ","당신은 "],[" missed update(s)!","개의 업데이트를 놓쳤습니다!"],["Translator++ will update itself if auto-update is enabled.","자동 업데이트가 활성화된 경우 Translator++는 자동으로 업데이트됩니다."],["You can download the latest core version of Translator++ at","Translator++의 최신 코어 버전은 다음에서 다운로드할 수 있습니다"],["This update is available for all patrons.","이 업데이트는 모든 후원자에게 제공됩니다."],["This update is available for tier $","이 업데이트는 티어 $"],[" patrons or greater."," 이상의 후원자에게 제공됩니다."],["You're up-to-date!","최신 상태입니다!"],["Thanks for staying up to date with Translator++! You're on the newest version, and we appreciate your support. Enjoy translating!","Translator++를 최신 상태로 유지해 주셔서 감사합니다! 최신 버전을 사용 중이며, 지원에 감사드립니다. 번역을 즐기세요!"],["Some update information may be shown from cache. You can click <b>'Check for update'</b> to load the latest version details.","일부 업데이트 정보는 캐시에서 표시될 수 있습니다. <b>'업데이트 확인'</b>을 클릭하여 최신 버전 세부 정보를 불러올 수 있습니다."],["When the same version is available","동일한 버전이 사용 가능할 때"],["Allow Translator++ to reinstall the same version of Translator++.","Translator++가 동일한 버전의 Translator++를 재설치하도록 허용합니다."],["Allow reinstall the same version","동일한 버전 재설치 허용"],["Update Settings","업데이트 설정"],["Update Now","지금 업데이트"],["Updater is not available, please update Translator++ manually.","업데이터를 사용할 수 없습니다. Translator++를 수동으로 업데이트해 주세요."],["Updating Translator++","Translator++ 업데이트 중"],["Please don't close Translator++ until the update process is finished.","업데이트 과정이 완료될 때까지 Translator++를 닫지 마세요."],["Can not update, reason :\n","업데이트할 수 없습니다. 이유:\n"],["You may need to reconnect Translator++ with your Patreon account (logout and login again).","Translator++를 Patreon 계정과 다시 연결해야 할 수 있습니다(로그아웃 후 다시 로그인)."],["Also, it has been reported that some countries such as mainland China are blocking dropbox repository.","또한, 중국 본토와 같은 일부 국가에서는 드롭박스 저장소를 차단하고 있다는 보고가 있습니다."],["If for some reason you cannot access our repository, please manually download the update package (tpch file) using a proxy or VPN here:","어떤 이유로든 우리 저장소에 접근할 수 없는 경우, 여기에서 프록시나 VPN을 사용하여 업데이트 패키지(tpch 파일)를 수동으로 다운로드해 주세요:"],["After that, please use the \"Update from package\" feature to update your Translator++.","그 후, \"패키지에서 업데이트\" 기능을 사용하여 Translator++를 업데이트하세요."],["If you still have problems, please contact us at our Discord server : ","여전히 문제가 있다면, Discord 서버에서 저희에게 연락해 주세요:"],["Restart","재시작"],["Do you want to restart Translator++ now?\nIf you have unsaved work, cancel this dialog and save your work first.","지금 Translator++를 재시작하시겠습니까?\n저장되지 않은 작업이 있다면, 이 대화 상자를 취소하고 작업을 먼저 저장하세요."],["Check for Update","업데이트 확인"],["Close","닫기"]],"context":[["tid/649/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/660/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/665/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/670/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1033/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1077/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1088/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1665/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1670/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1675/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1755/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1765/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1811/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1873/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2021/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2066/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2116/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2130/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2176/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2192/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2206/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2220/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2245/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2259/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2357/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2377/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2449/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2512/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"info.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"info.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/info.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"You have ":0," missed update(s)!":1,"Translator++ will update itself if auto-update is enabled.":2,"You can download the latest core version of Translator++ at":3,"This update is available for all patrons.":4,"This update is available for tier $":5," patrons or greater.":6,"You're up-to-date!":7,"Thanks for staying up to date with Translator++! You're on the newest version, and we appreciate your support. Enjoy translating!":8,"Some update information may be shown from cache. You can click <b>'Check for update'</b> to load the latest version details.":9,"When the same version is available":10,"Allow Translator++ to reinstall the same version of Translator++.":11,"Allow reinstall the same version":12,"Update Settings":13,"Update Now":14,"Updater is not available, please update Translator++ manually.":15,"Updating Translator++":16,"Please don't close Translator++ until the update process is finished.":17,"Can not update, reason :\n":18,"You may need to reconnect Translator++ with your Patreon account (logout and login again).":19,"Also, it has been reported that some countries such as mainland China are blocking dropbox repository.":20,"If for some reason you cannot access our repository, please manually download the update package (tpch file) using a proxy or VPN here:":21,"After that, please use the \"Update from package\" feature to update your Translator++.":22,"If you still have problems, please contact us at our Discord server : ":23,"Restart":24,"Do you want to restart Translator++ now?\nIf you have unsaved work, cancel this dialog and save your work first.":25,"Check for Update":26,"Close":27},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/uiTags.js":{"data":[["Do not process row with selected tag (blacklist)","선택한 태그가 있는 행을 처리하지 않음 (블랙리스트)"],["Only process row with selected tag (whitelist)","선택한 태그가 있는 행만 처리 (화이트리스트)"],["Ignore tag","태그 무시"],["Load last selection","마지막 선택 불러오기"],["Reset","초기화"],["Cancel","취소"],["Confirm","확인"]],"context":[["tid/55/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/60/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/65/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/410/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/415/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2085/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2137/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"uiTags.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"uiTags.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/uiTags.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Do not process row with selected tag (blacklist)":0,"Only process row with selected tag (whitelist)":1,"Ignore tag":2,"Load last selection":3,"Reset":4,"Cancel":5,"Confirm":6},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/customParser/CustomParserLoader.js":{"data":[["List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. Separate each value with a comma.<br />Translator++ will read the original file with the following encodings, patch the files and write with the <b>Write Character encoding</b> option. Leave blank to use the original character encoding when the project is created.","가능한 문자 인코딩 목록입니다. <b>순서가 중요합니다!</b>. 각 값을 쉼표로 구분하세요.<br />Translator++는 다음 인코딩으로 원본 파일을 읽고, 파일을 패치하며 <b>쓰기 문자 인코딩</b> 옵션으로 작성합니다. 비워두면 프로젝트 생성 시 원본 문자 인코딩을 사용합니다."],["For BOM support, add a space after the encoding. Example: <code>utf8 bom</code>","BOM 지원을 위해 인코딩 뒤에 공백을 추가하세요. 예: <code>utf8 bom</code>"],["Example: utf8,utf8 bom,utf16le,ascii","예: utf8,utf8 bom,utf16le,ascii"],["Select the target character encoding.","대상 문자 인코딩을 선택하세요."]],"context":[["tid/3375/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3383/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3392/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4740/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"CustomParserLoader.js","dirname":"/addons/customParser","extension":".js","filename":"CustomParserLoader.js","path":"/addons/customParser/CustomParserLoader.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. Separate each value with a comma.<br />Translator++ will read the original file with the following encodings, patch the files and write with the <b>Write Character encoding</b> option. Leave blank to use the original character encoding when the project is created.":0,"For BOM support, add a space after the encoding. Example: <code>utf8 bom</code>":1,"Example: utf8,utf8 bom,utf16le,ascii":2,"Select the target character encoding.":3},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.html":{"data":[["<i class=\"icon-edit\"></i>","<i class=\"icon-edit\"></i>"],["<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Add a new file group</label>","<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">새 파일 그룹 추가</label>"],["Add a new file group","새 파일 그룹 추가"],["<i class=\"icon-cancel-circled red\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Remove current file group</label>","<i class=\"icon-cancel-circled red\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">현재 파일 그룹 제거</label>"],["Remove current file group","현재 파일 그룹 제거"],["Rules","규칙"],["Hooks","훅"],["Options","옵션"],["Testing","테스트"],["Interpolate the strings before being displayed on the cells. <b>To Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>From Grid</b>","셀에 표시되기 전에 문자열을 보간합니다. <b>To Grid</b>는 <b>From Grid</b>의 반대입니다."],["Example","예시"],["For example, the text obtained from the parser is as follows:","예를 들어, 파서에서 얻은 텍스트는 다음과 같습니다:"],["In this grid it will look like this:","이 그리드에서는 다음과 같이 보일 것입니다:"],["That's not the easiest text to work with.<br>\n  We can fix that by declaring <span class=\"inlineCode\">To Grid hooks</span> as follows:\n","이것은 작업하기 가장 쉬운 텍스트가 아닙니다.<br>\n  다음과 같이 <span class=\"inlineCode\">To Grid 후크</span>를 선언하여 수정할 수 있습니다:\n"],["With the hook above the text in the grid will be :","위의 후크를 사용하면 그리드의 텍스트는 다음과 같을 것입니다:"],["Interpolate the strings from the cells into the translation result. <b>From Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>To Grid</b>.","셀에서 문자열을 번역 결과로 보간합니다. <b>From Grid</b>는 <b>To Grid</b>의 반대입니다."],["\n  For example, the expected translated strings should be in JSON format.<br>\n  But writing translation in JSON format is not realy the easiest thing to do. <br>\n  So, instead of asking our translator to translate in JSON format, we can just ask them to type normally, and add a <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> as follows:\n","\n  예를 들어, 예상되는 번역된 문자열은 JSON 형식이어야 합니다.<br>\n  하지만 JSON 형식으로 번역을 작성하는 것은 실제로 가장 쉬운 일이 아닙니다.<br>\n  따라서 번역가에게 JSON 형식으로 번역하도록 요청하는 대신, 그냥 일반적으로 입력하도록 요청하고 다음과 같이 <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid 후크</span>를 추가할 수 있습니다:\n"],["\n  With the <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> above, the following translation ...\n","\n  위의 <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid 후크</span>를 사용하면 다음 번역 ...\n"],["...will be converted into desired format: ","...이 원하는 형식으로 변환될 것입니다: "],["Edit the translated text just before writing it into a file.","파일에 쓰기 직전에 번역된 텍스트를 편집합니다."],["Parameters","매개변수"],["\n              <h3 data-tran=\"\">text</h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that is about to be written into a file.</p>\n            ","\n              <h3 data-tran=\"\">텍스트</h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">파일에 쓰여질 텍스트입니다.</p>\n            "],["text","텍스트"],["The text that is about to be written into a file.","파일에 쓰여질 텍스트입니다."],["Return value","반환 값"],["\n              <h3><i>String</i></h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that will be written into a file.</p>\n            ","\n              <h3><i>문자열</i></h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">파일에 쓰여질 텍스트입니다.</p>\n            "],["The text that will be written into a file.","파일에 쓰여질 텍스트입니다."],["General","일반"],["Read character encoding","문자 인코딩 읽기"],["Force parser to use the following character encoding when reading the file(s).","파일을 읽을 때 다음 문자 인코딩을 강제로 사용하도록 파서에 지시합니다."],["Write character encoding","문자 인코딩 쓰기"],["Force parser to use the following character encoding when writing the file(s).","파일을 쓸 때 다음 문자 인코딩을 강제로 사용하도록 파서에 지시합니다."],["You are editing:","편집 중:"],["Please select the mode of your pattern","패턴 모드를 선택하세요"],["Regular expression Pattern","정규 표현식 패턴"],["A valid ECMA Script's regular expression along with the modifier.<br>You can use <a href=\"https://regex101.com/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"\">regex101.com</a> to create and test your pattern.","유효한 ECMA Script 정규 표현식과 수정자를 포함합니다.<br><a href=\"https://regex101.com/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"\">regex101.com</a>을 사용하여 패턴을 만들고 테스트할 수 있습니다."],["Pay attention to the use of carriage return (\\r) in the text to be translated. regex101.com will strip out the carriage returns so your pattern may have a different effect than what you see on regex101. ","번역할 텍스트에서 캐리지 리턴(\\r) 사용에 주의하세요. regex101.com은 캐리지 리턴을 제거하므로 패턴이 regex101에서 보는 것과 다른 효과를 낼 수 있습니다."],["<strong>About quantifier that captures a zero length string.</strong><br>\n            <i>Null</i> strings will cause problems for the parser. Therefore, instead of using the <strong>*</strong> quantifier which will also capture <i>nulls</i>, it is highly recommended to use the <strong>+</strong> quantifier which will only capture strings if exist.","<strong>길이가 0인 문자열을 캡처하는 수량자에 대해.</strong><br>\n            <i>Null</i> 문자열은 파서에 문제를 일으킵니다. 따라서 <i>null</i>도 캡처하는 <strong>*</strong> 수량자 대신, 문자열이 존재할 때만 캡처하는 <strong>+</strong> 수량자를 사용하는 것이 강력히 권장됩니다."],["Translatable Capture groups","번역 가능한 캡처 그룹"],["Index of the regular expression's groups (Integer) for the translatable texts. Can be more than one. Separate with comma.","번역 가능한 텍스트를 위한 정규 표현식 그룹의 인덱스(정수). 여러 개일 수 있으며, 쉼표로 구분합니다."],["Row Info Capture group","행 정보 캡처 그룹"],["\n            Index of the regular expression's group (Integer) for the row info (e.g. character name). <b>Only one group</b> is allowed. <br>\n            The value of the Row info can be carried over to the child rules and will be overwritten by the child rule's Row info value if exist.\n          ","\n            행 정보(예: 캐릭터 이름)를 위한 정규 표현식 그룹의 인덱스(정수). <b>하나의 그룹만</b> 허용됩니다. <br>\n            행 정보 값은 하위 규칙으로 이어질 수 있으며, 하위 규칙에 행 정보 값이 있으면 덮어쓰기됩니다.\n          "],["Context template","컨텍스트 템플릿"],["\n            Context is unique identifier for translatable texts. <br>\n            You can use Javascript's template literals to add information to the context.<br>\n            <b>Available variable:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">GROUP[<i>n</i>]</span> - Group capture.</li>\n              <!-- <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">RULE_ID</span> - The ID of the rule.</li> -->\n            </ul>\n            <br>\n            <b>Example:</b>\n            <pre>item/${GROUP[2]}</pre>\n          ","\n            컨텍스트는 번역 가능한 텍스트의 고유 식별자입니다. <br>\n            Javascript의 템플릿 리터럴을 사용하여 컨텍스트에 정보를 추가할 수 있습니다.<br>\n            <b>사용 가능한 변수:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">GROUP[<i>n</i>]</span> - 그룹 캡처.</li>\n              <!-- <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">RULE_ID</span> - 규칙의 ID.</li> -->\n            </ul>\n            <br>\n            <b>예시:</b>\n            <pre>item/${GROUP[2]}</pre>\n          "],["Action","작업"],["Capture value","값 캡처"],["Capture then mask value","값 캡처 후 마스킹"],["Mask value","값 마스킹"],["Send to inner rule","내부 규칙으로 보내기"],["Edit inner rule <i class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></i>","내부 규칙 편집 <i class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></i>"],["What action the pattern is going to do.","패턴이 수행할 작업입니다."],["Javascript function","자바스크립트 함수"],["Guide","가이드"],["\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Arguments</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <h3>text</h3>\n              <p><b>String</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">A string of the entire content of the file.</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>thisModel</h3>\n              <p><b>Object</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The rule object that is currently used by the file.</p>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\"><i>this</i> Keyword</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\"><b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.</p>\n\n        ","\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">인수</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">작성하는 코드는 2개의 인수를 가진 함수 내부에 위치하며, 코드 어디서든 접근할 수 있습니다:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <h3>text</h3>\n              <p><b>문자열</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">파일 전체 내용의 문자열입니다.</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>thisModel</h3>\n              <p><b>객체</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">현재 파일에서 사용 중인 규칙 객체입니다.</p>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\"><i>this</i> 키워드</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\"><b>this</b>는 CustomParser 클래스의 인스턴스를 참조합니다.</p>\n\n        "],["Arguments","인수"],["The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:","작성하는 코드는 2개의 인수를 가진 함수 내부에 위치하며, 코드 어디서든 접근할 수 있습니다:"],["A string of the entire content of the file.","파일 전체 내용의 문자열입니다."],["The rule object that is currently used by the file.","현재 파일에서 사용 중인 규칙 객체입니다."],["<i>this</i> Keyword","<i>this</i> 키워드"],["<b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.","<b>this</b>는 CustomParser 클래스의 인스턴스를 참조합니다."],["\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Expected Return Value</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><pre>undefined</pre></li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            </li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        ","\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">예상 반환 값</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">코드는 다음 값 중 하나를 <b>반환</b>해야 합니다:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><pre>undefined</pre></li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">캡처된 텍스트의 오프셋, 예시:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"캐릭터 이름\", // 캐릭터 이름. 선택 사항\n    context: [\"일부\", \"컨텍스트\", \"여기\"] // 컨텍스트. 선택 사항\n  }\n</pre>\n            </li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">캡처된 텍스트의 오프셋 배열, 예시:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"캐릭터 이름\", context: [\"일부\", \"컨텍스트\", \"여기\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"다른 캐릭터\", context: [\"다른\", \"컨텍스트\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"세 번째 캐릭터\", context: [\"세 번째\", \"컨텍스트\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        "],["Expected Return Value","예상 반환 값"],["Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:","코드는 다음 값 중 하나를 <b>반환</b>해야 합니다:"],["Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            ","캡처된 텍스트의 오프셋, 예시:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"캐릭터 이름\", // 캐릭터 이름. 선택 사항\n    context: [\"일부\", \"컨텍스트\", \"여기\"] // 컨텍스트. 선택 사항\n  }\n</pre>\n            "],["Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            ","캡처된 텍스트의 오프셋 배열, 예시:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"캐릭터 이름\", context: [\"일부\", \"컨텍스트\", \"여기\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"다른 캐릭터\", context: [\"다른\", \"컨텍스트\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"세 번째 캐릭터\", context: [\"세 번째\", \"컨텍스트\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            "],["\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Example</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">\n/*\n  Translator++ is using regexp-match-indices\n  by that all RegExp.exec() method will return their group offset\n  read more about Regular Expression Indices here: https://v8.dev/features/regexp-match-indices\n*/\n\nvar result \t\t\t= [];\nvar captureGroup \t= 1;\nvar regex \t\t\t= /\\d+[\\r\\n]+\\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+ --&gt; \\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+[\\r\\n]+((.+\\r?\\n)+(?=(\\r?\\n)?))/g;\nwhile(null != (matches=regex.exec(text))) {\n  console.log(matches);\n  if (!matches?.indices?.[captureGroup]) continue;\n  result.push({\n    start\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][0],\n    end\t\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][1]\n  })\n}\nreturn result;             \n</code>\n</pre>\n        ","\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">예시</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">다음 코드는 srt 자막을 파싱하는 예시입니다.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">\n/*\n  Translator++는 regexp-match-indices를 사용합니다.\n  이를 통해 모든 RegExp.exec() 메서드는 그룹 오프셋을 반환합니다.\n  정규 표현식 인덱스에 대한 자세한 내용은 여기에서 확인하세요: https://v8.dev/features/regexp-match-indices\n*/\n\nvar result \t\t\t= [];\nvar captureGroup \t= 1;\nvar regex \t\t\t= /\\d+[\\r\\n]+\\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+ --&gt; \\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+[\\r\\n]+((.+\\r?\\n)+(?=(\\r?\\n)?))/g;\nwhile(null != (matches=regex.exec(text))) {\n  console.log(matches);\n  if (!matches?.indices?.[captureGroup]) continue;\n  result.push({\n    start\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][0],\n    end\t\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][1]\n  })\n}\nreturn result;             \n</code>\n</pre>\n        "],["The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.","다음 코드는 srt 자막을 파싱하는 예시입니다."],["Welcome to the Custom Parser Model Creator","커스텀 파서 모델 생성기에 오신 것을 환영합니다"],["Please start by creating a new File Group.","새 파일 그룹을 생성하여 시작하세요."],["Please define what kind of file you want to parse by clicking\n      <button class=\"addFileGroup\" onclick=\"addFileGroup(this)\"><i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i>Add a new file group</button> button.\n    ","파일을 파싱할 유형을 정의하려면\n      <button class=\"addFileGroup\" onclick=\"addFileGroup(this)\"><i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i>새 파일 그룹 추가</button> 버튼을 클릭하세요.\n    "],["Press F1 to open the help dialog.","도움말 대화 상자를 열려면 F1을 누르세요."],["New File","새 파일"],["Open file","파일 열기"],["Save file","파일 저장"],["Save As","다른 이름으로 저장"],["Open debugger (F12)","디버거 열기 (F12)"],["Help","도움말"],["Edit current file pattern","현재 파일 패턴 편집"],["Add a new file pattern","새 파일 패턴 추가"],["Remove current file pattern","현재 파일 패턴 제거"],["Rule's order does matter, especially when you use masking! Drag to reorder.","규칙 순서는 중요합니다, 특히 마스킹을 사용할 때! 재정렬하려면 드래그하세요."]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/3/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText","idx/29/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/9/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText","idx/16/innerText","idx/28/innerText","idx/69/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/24/innerText"],["idx/25/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/30/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/35/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/38/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/41/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/44/innerText"],["idx/45/innerText"],["idx/46/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"],["idx/48/innerText"],["idx/49/innerText"],["idx/50/innerText"],["idx/51/innerText"],["idx/52/innerText"],["idx/53/innerText"],["idx/54/innerText"],["idx/55/innerText"],["idx/56/innerText"],["idx/57/innerText"],["idx/58/innerText"],["idx/59/innerText"],["idx/60/innerText"],["idx/61/innerText"],["idx/62/innerText"],["idx/63/innerText"],["idx/64/innerText"],["idx/65/innerText"],["idx/66/innerText"],["idx/67/innerText"],["idx/68/innerText"],["idx/70/innerText"],["idx/71/innerText"],["idx/72/innerText"],["idx/73/innerText"],["idx/74/innerText"],["idx/0/attr/title"],["idx/1/attr/title"],["idx/2/attr/title"],["idx/3/attr/title"],["idx/4/attr/title"],["idx/5/attr/title"],["idx/6/attr/title"],["idx/7/attr/title"],["idx/8/attr/title"],["idx/9/attr/title"]],"basename":"modelEditor.html","dirname":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor","extension":".html","filename":"modelEditor.html","path":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"<i class=\"icon-edit\"></i>":0,"<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Add a new file group</label>":1,"Add a new file group":2,"<i class=\"icon-cancel-circled red\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Remove current file group</label>":3,"Remove current file group":4,"Rules":5,"Hooks":6,"Options":7,"Testing":8,"Interpolate the strings before being displayed on the cells. <b>To Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>From Grid</b>":9,"Example":10,"For example, the text obtained from the parser is as follows:":11,"In this grid it will look like this:":12,"That's not the easiest text to work with.<br>\n  We can fix that by declaring <span class=\"inlineCode\">To Grid hooks</span> as follows:\n":13,"With the hook above the text in the grid will be :":14,"Interpolate the strings from the cells into the translation result. <b>From Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>To Grid</b>.":15,"\n  For example, the expected translated strings should be in JSON format.<br>\n  But writing translation in JSON format is not realy the easiest thing to do. <br>\n  So, instead of asking our translator to translate in JSON format, we can just ask them to type normally, and add a <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> as follows:\n":16,"\n  With the <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> above, the following translation ...\n":17,"...will be converted into desired format: ":18,"Edit the translated text just before writing it into a file.":19,"Parameters":20,"\n              <h3 data-tran=\"\">text</h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that is about to be written into a file.</p>\n            ":21,"text":22,"The text that is about to be written into a file.":23,"Return value":24,"\n              <h3><i>String</i></h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that will be written into a file.</p>\n            ":25,"The text that will be written into a file.":26,"General":27,"Read character encoding":28,"Force parser to use the following character encoding when reading the file(s).":29,"Write character encoding":30,"Force parser to use the following character encoding when writing the file(s).":31,"You are editing:":32,"Please select the mode of your pattern":33,"Regular expression Pattern":34,"A valid ECMA Script's regular expression along with the modifier.<br>You can use <a href=\"https://regex101.com/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"\">regex101.com</a> to create and test your pattern.":35,"Pay attention to the use of carriage return (\\r) in the text to be translated. regex101.com will strip out the carriage returns so your pattern may have a different effect than what you see on regex101. ":36,"<strong>About quantifier that captures a zero length string.</strong><br>\n            <i>Null</i> strings will cause problems for the parser. Therefore, instead of using the <strong>*</strong> quantifier which will also capture <i>nulls</i>, it is highly recommended to use the <strong>+</strong> quantifier which will only capture strings if exist.":37,"Translatable Capture groups":38,"Index of the regular expression's groups (Integer) for the translatable texts. Can be more than one. Separate with comma.":39,"Row Info Capture group":40,"\n            Index of the regular expression's group (Integer) for the row info (e.g. character name). <b>Only one group</b> is allowed. <br>\n            The value of the Row info can be carried over to the child rules and will be overwritten by the child rule's Row info value if exist.\n          ":41,"Context template":42,"\n            Context is unique identifier for translatable texts. <br>\n            You can use Javascript's template literals to add information to the context.<br>\n            <b>Available variable:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">GROUP[<i>n</i>]</span> - Group capture.</li>\n              <!-- <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">RULE_ID</span> - The ID of the rule.</li> -->\n            </ul>\n            <br>\n            <b>Example:</b>\n            <pre>item/${GROUP[2]}</pre>\n          ":43,"Action":44,"Capture value":45,"Capture then mask value":46,"Mask value":47,"Send to inner rule":48,"Edit inner rule <i class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></i>":49,"What action the pattern is going to do.":50,"Javascript function":51,"Guide":52,"\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Arguments</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <h3>text</h3>\n              <p><b>String</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">A string of the entire content of the file.</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>thisModel</h3>\n              <p><b>Object</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The rule object that is currently used by the file.</p>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\"><i>this</i> Keyword</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\"><b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.</p>\n\n        ":53,"Arguments":54,"The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:":55,"A string of the entire content of the file.":56,"The rule object that is currently used by the file.":57,"<i>this</i> Keyword":58,"<b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.":59,"\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Expected Return Value</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><pre>undefined</pre></li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            </li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        ":60,"Expected Return Value":61,"Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:":62,"Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            ":63,"Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            ":64,"\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Example</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">\n/*\n  Translator++ is using regexp-match-indices\n  by that all RegExp.exec() method will return their group offset\n  read more about Regular Expression Indices here: https://v8.dev/features/regexp-match-indices\n*/\n\nvar result \t\t\t= [];\nvar captureGroup \t= 1;\nvar regex \t\t\t= /\\d+[\\r\\n]+\\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+ --&gt; \\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+[\\r\\n]+((.+\\r?\\n)+(?=(\\r?\\n)?))/g;\nwhile(null != (matches=regex.exec(text))) {\n  console.log(matches);\n  if (!matches?.indices?.[captureGroup]) continue;\n  result.push({\n    start\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][0],\n    end\t\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][1]\n  })\n}\nreturn result;             \n</code>\n</pre>\n        ":65,"The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.":66,"Welcome to the Custom Parser Model Creator":67,"Please start by creating a new File Group.":68,"Please define what kind of file you want to parse by clicking\n      <button class=\"addFileGroup\" onclick=\"addFileGroup(this)\"><i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i>Add a new file group</button> button.\n    ":69,"Press F1 to open the help dialog.":70,"New File":71,"Open file":72,"Save file":73,"Save As":74,"Open debugger (F12)":75,"Help":76,"Edit current file pattern":77,"Add a new file pattern":78,"Remove current file pattern":79,"Rule's order does matter, especially when you use masking! Drag to reorder.":80},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.js":{"data":[["Do you want to close Model editor?\rAll unsaved changes will be discarded.","모델 편집기를 닫으시겠습니까?\r저장되지 않은 모든 변경 사항은 삭제됩니다."],["Translate here using ","여기서 번역하기 "],["Do you want to discard your changes and open\n","변경 사항을 삭제하고 열기를 원하십니까?\n"],["Error when trying to open file :","파일을 열려고 할 때 오류 발생:"],["Parser Model Creator","파서 모델 생성기"],["Please specify what kind of file you want to parse.\nYou can use semicolon separated glob pattens. For example: *.txt;*.js;*.json","파싱할 파일 유형을 지정하세요.\n세미콜론으로 구분된 글로브 패턴을 사용할 수 있습니다. 예: *.txt;*.js;*.json"],["Failed to create new file group. Please check your pattern!","새 파일 그룹 생성에 실패했습니다. 패턴을 확인하세요!"],["Do you wish to remove current file group?\nYou can not undo this action!","현재 파일 그룹을 제거하시겠습니까?\n이 작업은 취소할 수 없습니다!"],["Do you want to discard your changes and create a new blank model?","변경 사항을 취소하고 새로운 빈 모델을 생성하시겠습니까?"],["Do you want to discard your changes and open a file?","변경 사항을 취소하고 파일을 열겠습니까?"],["Clear history","기록 지우기"],["Open latest file","최신 파일 열기"],["Open from history","기록에서 열기"],["This feature only available if you are using Developer version of Translator++. You can switch into Developer version by using Basic Utilities -> Change Core NWJS.","이 기능은 Translator++의 개발자 버전을 사용할 때만 이용 가능합니다. 기본 유틸리티 -> 코어 NWJS 변경을 통해 개발자 버전으로 전환할 수 있습니다."]],"context":[["tid/156/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5647/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9760/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10037/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10099/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10622/type/StringLiteral","tid/10941/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10665/type/StringLiteral","tid/10987/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11026/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11104/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11174/type/StringLiteral","tid/12080/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11459/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11525/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11607/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11750/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"modelEditor.js","dirname":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor","extension":".js","filename":"modelEditor.js","path":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Do you want to close Model editor?\rAll unsaved changes will be discarded.":0,"Translate here using ":1,"Do you want to discard your changes and open\n":2,"Error when trying to open file :":3,"Parser Model Creator":4,"Please specify what kind of file you want to parse.\nYou can use semicolon separated glob pattens. For example: *.txt;*.js;*.json":5,"Failed to create new file group. Please check your pattern!":6,"Do you wish to remove current file group?\nYou can not undo this action!":7,"Do you want to discard your changes and create a new blank model?":8,"Do you want to discard your changes and open a file?":9,"Clear history":10,"Open latest file":11,"Open from history":12,"This feature only available if you are using Developer version of Translator++. You can switch into Developer version by using Basic Utilities -> Change Core NWJS.":13},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/googleCloudV3/trans.googleCloudV3.js":{"data":[["Invalid language string","잘못된 언어 문자열"],["Required field Project ID is blank!","필수 항목 프로젝트 ID가 비어 있습니다!"],["Required field Service Account Key is blank!","필수 항목 서비스 계정 키가 비어 있습니다!"],["Required field Server Location is blank!","필수 항목 서버 위치가 비어 있습니다!"],["Required field Location of the glossary file is blank!","필수 항목 용어집 파일 위치가 비어 있습니다!"],["Required field Glossary Languages is blank!","필수 항목 용어집 언어가 비어 있습니다!"],["Invalid glossary language value","잘못된 용어집 언어 값"],["Currently active glossary on this project: ","현재 이 프로젝트에서 활성화된 용어집: "],["Error when retreiving glossary info: ","용어집 정보를 검색하는 중 오류 발생: "],["Error when removing glossary : ","용어집 제거 중 오류 발생: "],["Glossary removed successfully.","용어집이 성공적으로 제거되었습니다."],["Error when creating glossary : ","용어집 생성 중 오류 발생: "],["Glossary created successfully.","용어집이 성공적으로 생성되었습니다."],["Configuration error:\r\n","구성 오류:\r\n"],["No error found!","오류를 찾을 수 없습니다!"],["Node JS is required to use Google Cloud Translate Advanced. Please download and install it from https://node.js","Google Cloud Translate Advanced를 사용하려면 Node JS가 필요합니다. https://node.js에서 다운로드하여 설치하세요."]],"context":[["tid/2012/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3382/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3437/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3499/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3554/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3609/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3640/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3738/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3819/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3903/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3932/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4007/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4036/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4510/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4546/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6155/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"trans.googleCloudV3.js","dirname":"/addons/googleCloudV3","extension":".js","filename":"trans.googleCloudV3.js","path":"/addons/googleCloudV3/trans.googleCloudV3.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Invalid language string":0,"Required field Project ID is blank!":1,"Required field Service Account Key is blank!":2,"Required field Server Location is blank!":3,"Required field Location of the glossary file is blank!":4,"Required field Glossary Languages is blank!":5,"Invalid glossary language value":6,"Currently active glossary on this project: ":7,"Error when retreiving glossary info: ":8,"Error when removing glossary : ":9,"Glossary removed successfully.":10,"Error when creating glossary : ":11,"Glossary created successfully.":12,"Configuration error:\r\n":13,"No error found!":14,"Node JS is required to use Google Cloud Translate Advanced. Please download and install it from https://node.js":15},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/jcap/jcap.js":{"data":[["JCap executable not found at the specified location. Do you want to install JCap?","지정된 위치에서 JCap 실행 파일을 찾을 수 없습니다. JCap을 설치하시겠습니까?"],["JCap agent started successfully. Press ","JCap 에이전트가 성공적으로 시작되었습니다. "],["jcapKey","jcapKey"],["Please set the JCap executable path in the addon settings.","애드온 설정에서 JCap 실행 파일 경로를 설정하세요."],["JCap executable already exists at the specified location.","지정된 위치에 JCap 실행 파일이 이미 존재합니다."],["JCap executable downloaded successfully.","JCap 실행 파일이 성공적으로 다운로드되었습니다."],["Failed to download JCap package. Please check the console for details.","JCap 패키지 다운로드에 실패했습니다. 자세한 내용은 콘솔을 확인하세요."],["JCap executable unpacked successfully.","JCap 실행 파일이 성공적으로 압축 해제되었습니다."],["You can now start the JCap agent from the Main Menu - Tools - OCR Tools JCap - Start JCap Agent.","이제 메인 메뉴 - 도구 - OCR 도구 JCap - JCap 에이전트 시작에서 JCap 에이전트를 시작할 수 있습니다."],["Start JCap OCR Agent","JCap OCR 에이전트 시작"],["Failed to unpack JCap package. Please check the console for details.","JCap 패키지 압축 해제에 실패했습니다. 자세한 내용은 콘솔을 확인하세요."],["JCap executable not found at the specified location.","지정된 위치에서 JCap 실행 파일을 찾을 수 없습니다."],["Are you sure you want to uninstall JCap? This will delete the JCap executable and its configuration.","JCap을 제거하시겠습니까? 이 작업은 JCap 실행 파일과 구성을 삭제합니다."],["JCap uninstalled successfully.","JCap이 성공적으로 제거되었습니다."],["Failed to uninstall JCap. Please check the console for details.","JCap 제거에 실패했습니다. 자세한 내용은 콘솔을 확인하세요."],["Help","도움말"],["JCap OCR is an OCR tool that allows you to capture text from the screen and translate it using JCap. To use it start the JCap by clicking the OCR button on main menu.\nThen press the configured key (default: F9) to capture text.","JCap OCR은 화면에서 텍스트를 캡처하고 JCap을 사용하여 번역할 수 있는 OCR 도구입니다. 사용하려면 메인 메뉴의 OCR 버튼을 클릭하여 JCap을 시작하세요.\n그런 다음 구성된 키(기본값: F9)를 눌러 텍스트를 캡처하세요."]],"context":[["tid/736/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/854/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/862/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1005/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1038/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1392/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1442/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1554/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1566/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1591/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1647/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1732/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1755/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1828/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1861/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2350/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2371/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"jcap.js","dirname":"/addons/jcap","extension":".js","filename":"jcap.js","path":"/addons/jcap/jcap.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"JCap executable not found at the specified location. Do you want to install JCap?":0,"JCap agent started successfully. Press ":1,"jcapKey":2,"Please set the JCap executable path in the addon settings.":3,"JCap executable already exists at the specified location.":4,"JCap executable downloaded successfully.":5,"Failed to download JCap package. Please check the console for details.":6,"JCap executable unpacked successfully.":7,"You can now start the JCap agent from the Main Menu - Tools - OCR Tools JCap - Start JCap Agent.":8,"Start JCap OCR Agent":9,"Failed to unpack JCap package. Please check the console for details.":10,"JCap executable not found at the specified location.":11,"Are you sure you want to uninstall JCap? This will delete the JCap executable and its configuration.":12,"JCap uninstalled successfully.":13,"Failed to uninstall JCap. Please check the console for details.":14,"Help":15,"JCap OCR is an OCR tool that allows you to capture text from the screen and translate it using JCap. To use it start the JCap by clicking the OCR button on main menu.\nThen press the configured key (default: F9) to capture text.":16},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/jsonParser/json.js":{"data":[["Beautify JSON data","JSON 데이터 정리"],["When checked the generated data will be beautified.","체크 시 생성된 데이터가 정리됩니다."],["Start a new translation project from any JSON file.","어떤 JSON 파일에서든 새 번역 프로젝트를 시작합니다."],["Translator++ will translate any translatable texts found in the JSON files.","Translator++는 JSON 파일에서 발견된 모든 번역 가능한 텍스트를 번역합니다."],["Read the guide on how to start a new JSON translation project here","새 JSON 번역 프로젝트를 시작하는 방법에 대한 가이드를 여기서 읽어보세요"],["Translator++ will scan through this folder for any JSON files.","Translator++는 이 폴더를 스캔하여 JSON 파일을 찾습니다."],["How do you want to get the data from the JSON object?","JSON 객체에서 데이터를 어떻게 가져오시겠습니까?"],["Parser mode","파서 모드"],["<h2>Simple Mode</h2><p>In simple mode, you can translate all strings value recursively inside the JSON object.<br />In simple mode, the original texts is always the value.</p>","<h2>단순 모드</h2><p>단순 모드에서는 JSON 객체 내부의 모든 문자열 값을 재귀적으로 번역할 수 있습니다.<br />단순 모드에서는 원본 텍스트가 항상 값입니다.</p>"],["<h2>Advanced Mode</h2><p>In advanced mode you can query the JSON and handle key-value paired type translation table where the original text is the key.</p>","<h2>고급 모드</h2><p>고급 모드에서는 JSON을 쿼리하고 원본 텍스트가 키인 키-값 쌍 유형 번역 테이블을 처리할 수 있습니다.</p>"],["<h2>Info</h2><p>You can use the following query field to select a specific part of the JSON object. The result of the query must be an object or an array of texts.</p>","<h2>정보</h2><p>다음 쿼리 필드를 사용하여 JSON 객체의 특정 부분을 선택할 수 있습니다. 쿼리 결과는 객체 또는 텍스트 배열이어야 합니다.</p>"],["<h3>For objects</h3><p>The <b>key will be used as the original text</b> and <b>the value as the default translation</b>.</p>","<h3>객체의 경우</h3><p><b>키가 원본 텍스트로 사용</b>되고 <b>값이 기본 번역으로 사용</b>됩니다.</p>"],["Parser will automatically register if the value is a string, null, or undefined.<br />","값이 문자열, null 또는 undefined이면 파서가 자동으로 등록됩니다.<br />"],["<h3>For arrays</h3><p>The parser will register all string values in the array as translatable texts.</p>","<h3>배열의 경우</h3><p>파서는 배열의 모든 문자열 값을 번역 가능한 텍스트로 등록합니다.</p>"],["Start project","프로젝트 시작"],["`Invalid destination directory:\\n${","`잘못된 대상 디렉토리:\\n${"],["}`","}`"]],"context":[["tid/92/type/StringLiteral","tid/119/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/102/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2826/type/StringLiteral","tid/2879/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2831/type/StringLiteral","tid/2884/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2836/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2998/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3038/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3214/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3293/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3346/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3446/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3451/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3456/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3461/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3615/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4070/type/TemplateHead"],["tid/4072/type/TemplateTail"]],"basename":"json.js","dirname":"/addons/jsonParser","extension":".js","filename":"json.js","path":"/addons/jsonParser/json.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Beautify JSON data":0,"When checked the generated data will be beautified.":1,"Start a new translation project from any JSON file.":2,"Translator++ will translate any translatable texts found in the JSON files.":3,"Read the guide on how to start a new JSON translation project here":4,"Translator++ will scan through this folder for any JSON files.":5,"How do you want to get the data from the JSON object?":6,"Parser mode":7,"<h2>Simple Mode</h2><p>In simple mode, you can translate all strings value recursively inside the JSON object.<br />In simple mode, the original texts is always the value.</p>":8,"<h2>Advanced Mode</h2><p>In advanced mode you can query the JSON and handle key-value paired type translation table where the original text is the key.</p>":9,"<h2>Info</h2><p>You can use the following query field to select a specific part of the JSON object. The result of the query must be an object or an array of texts.</p>":10,"<h3>For objects</h3><p>The <b>key will be used as the original text</b> and <b>the value as the default translation</b>.</p>":11,"Parser will automatically register if the value is a string, null, or undefined.<br />":12,"<h3>For arrays</h3><p>The parser will register all string values in the array as translatable texts.</p>":13,"Start project":14,"`Invalid destination directory:\\n${":15,"}`":16},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/kagParser/TyranoParser.js":{"data":[["label","레이블"],["is duplicated in the same scenario file","동일한 시나리오 파일에서 중복됨"]],"context":[["tid/2372/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2390/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"TyranoParser.js","dirname":"/addons/kagParser","extension":".js","filename":"TyranoParser.js","path":"/addons/kagParser/TyranoParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"label":0,"is duplicated in the same scenario file":1},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/kagParser/kagParser.js":{"data":[["Select directory","디렉토리 선택"],["Select a directory to repack","재포장할 디렉토리 선택"],["Target xp3","대상 xp3"],["Select filename. Special filename such as <b>patch.xp3</b>, <b>patch2.xp3</b>...etc get priority over data.xp3 when loaded.","파일명 선택. <b>patch.xp3</b>, <b>patch2.xp3</b>...등과 같은 특수 파일명은 로드 시 data.xp3보다 우선순위를 가집니다."],["Patch to allow folder structure","폴더 구조 허용 패치"],["By default KAG engine do not read files inside a folder within xp3 files. This option will automatically add folder structure definition to Config.tjs. Has no effect if no Config.tjs file is found.","기본적으로 KAG 엔진은 xp3 파일 내의 폴더 안 파일을 읽지 않습니다. 이 옵션은 Config.tjs에 폴더 구조 정의를 자동으로 추가합니다. Config.tjs 파일이 없으면 효과가 없습니다."],["Repack into xp3","xp3로 재포장"],["Close","닫기"],["Process","처리"],["<b>Order does matter</b> if you unpack multiple files at once! The files will be unpacked in ordered manner. If the files exist it will be overwritten.","여러 파일을 한 번에 압축 해제할 경우 <b>순서가 중요합니다</b>! 파일은 순서대로 압축 해제되며, 파일이 존재하면 덮어쓰기됩니다."],["Unpack XP3 files","XP3 파일 압축 해제"],["Repack a folder to xp3","폴더를 xp3로 재포장"],["Unpack xp3 file","xp3 파일 압축 해제"],["Before you create a new project, please make sure that :","새 프로젝트를 생성하기 전에 다음 사항을 확인하세요:"],["All .ks & .tjs files are in plain text (uncompiled, unscrambled, and unencrypted)","모든 .ks 및 .tjs 파일이 일반 텍스트(컴파일되지 않음, 스크램블되지 않음, 암호화되지 않음)여야 합니다"],["KAG Games should be playable even without being repacked. So you should check whether your game is playable or not after being extracted.","KAG 게임은 재포장 없이도 플레이 가능해야 합니다. 따라서 추출 후 게임이 플레이 가능한지 확인해야 합니다."],["Some of the actions will modify your game. <b>So make sure to create a backup of your game!</b>","일부 작업은 게임을 수정합니다. <b>게임의 백업을 반드시 생성하세요!</b>"],["Select the game executable file. This file is the main game file that will be used to extract the game data.","게임 실행 파일을 선택하세요. 이 파일은 게임 데이터를 추출하는 데 사용될 메인 게임 파일입니다."],["Translator++ can extract XP3 files with AEC addon. <b>But the extractor is not a surefire solution for all kind XP3</b>.","Translator++는 AEC 애드온으로 XP3 파일을 추출할 수 있습니다. <b>하지만 추출기가 모든 종류의 XP3에 대해 확실한 솔루션은 아닙니다</b>."],["Some scenario files are encrypted. Check this option if you wish Translator++ to try to decrypt them.","일부 시나리오 파일은 암호화되어 있습니다. Translator++가 암호 해독을 시도하도록 하려면 이 옵션을 선택하세요."],["This may not work on some projects.","일부 프로젝트에서는 작동하지 않을 수 있습니다."],["List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. You can drag to sort the list.","가능한 문자 인코딩 목록입니다. <b>순서가 중요합니다!</b> 목록을 드래그하여 정렬할 수 있습니다."],["Literal tags are the tags that will be escaped into Translator++ editor.","리터럴 태그는 Translator++ 편집기에서 이스케이프될 태그입니다."],["<b>ruby l r</b> are mandatory.","<b>ruby l r</b>은 필수입니다."],["<b>[r]</b> Tags will be interpolated by Translator++ into a new line. So you don't need to write <b>[r]</b> explicitly.","<b>[r]</b> 태그는 Translator++에 의해 새 줄로 보간됩니다. 따라서 <b>[r]</b>을 명시적으로 작성할 필요가 없습니다."],["Kirikiri script (.ks) is heavily customizable and allows developers to create their own tags.","Kirikiri 스크립트(.ks)는 매우 사용자 정의 가능하며 개발자가 자신만의 태그를 생성할 수 있습니다."],["Translator++ can handle standard tags such as character names that start with a sharp (#).","Translator++는 샵(#)으로 시작하는 캐릭터 이름과 같은 표준 태그를 처리할 수 있습니다."],["However, Translator++ cannot handle custom tags created by developers.","그러나 Translator++는 개발자가 생성한 사용자 정의 태그를 처리할 수 없습니다."],["Therefore, you may need to define the tags and attributes that need to be translated and those that need to be marked as actor names.","따라서 번역이 필요한 태그와 속성, 그리고 배우 이름으로 표시해야 할 태그를 정의해야 할 수 있습니다."],["You might need to <input type=\"button\" value=\"extract your xp3 game\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.kagParser.utils.unpackXP3Dialog()\" /> and analyze the ks script inside it before starting the project.","프로젝트를 시작하기 전에 <input type=\"button\" value=\"xp3 게임 추출\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.kagParser.utils.unpackXP3Dialog()\" />하고 내부의 ks 스크립트를 분석해야 할 수 있습니다."],["Create Project","프로젝트 생성"],["Pack a folder into xp3","폴더를 xp3로 패킹"],["Select the target character encoding.<br />Most Japanese KAG games are written with SHIFT-JIS, but KAG actually has support for UTF16LE unicode. Many translators set the character encoding to UTF16LE so that the game is playable non-Japanese windows without locale emulator. And most importantly, can displays characters outside SHIFT-JIS such as \"café\".<br />By default Translator++ will write to its original character encoding.","대상 문자 인코딩을 선택하세요.<br />대부분의 일본어 KAG 게임은 SHIFT-JIS로 작성되지만, KAG는 실제로 UTF16LE 유니코드를 지원합니다. 많은 번역가들은 로케일 에뮬레이터 없이 비일본어 Windows에서 게임을 실행 가능하게 하고, \"café\"와 같이 SHIFT-JIS 외의 문자를 표시할 수 있도록 문자 인코딩을 UTF16LE로 설정합니다.<br />기본적으로 Translator++는 원본 문자 인코딩으로 작성합니다."],["There are several ways to produce playable localized game for KAG. Please select one that suit your preference.","KAG용 로컬라이즈된 게임을 생성하는 여러 방법이 있습니다. 선호도에 맞는 방법을 선택하세요."]],"context":[["tid/2913/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2918/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2925/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2930/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2937/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2942/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3173/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3274/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3325/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3558/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3684/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3872/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3929/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4297/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4302/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4307/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4312/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4468/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4508/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4549/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4583/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4631/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4640/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4649/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5046/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5053/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5060/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5067/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5078/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5389/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6942/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7218/type/StringLiteral","tid/7397/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7462/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"kagParser.js","dirname":"/addons/kagParser","extension":".js","filename":"kagParser.js","path":"/addons/kagParser/kagParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Select directory":0,"Select a directory to repack":1,"Target xp3":2,"Select filename. Special filename such as <b>patch.xp3</b>, <b>patch2.xp3</b>...etc get priority over data.xp3 when loaded.":3,"Patch to allow folder structure":4,"By default KAG engine do not read files inside a folder within xp3 files. This option will automatically add folder structure definition to Config.tjs. Has no effect if no Config.tjs file is found.":5,"Repack into xp3":6,"Close":7,"Process":8,"<b>Order does matter</b> if you unpack multiple files at once! The files will be unpacked in ordered manner. If the files exist it will be overwritten.":9,"Unpack XP3 files":10,"Repack a folder to xp3":11,"Unpack xp3 file":12,"Before you create a new project, please make sure that :":13,"All .ks & .tjs files are in plain text (uncompiled, unscrambled, and unencrypted)":14,"KAG Games should be playable even without being repacked. So you should check whether your game is playable or not after being extracted.":15,"Some of the actions will modify your game. <b>So make sure to create a backup of your game!</b>":16,"Select the game executable file. This file is the main game file that will be used to extract the game data.":17,"Translator++ can extract XP3 files with AEC addon. <b>But the extractor is not a surefire solution for all kind XP3</b>.":18,"Some scenario files are encrypted. Check this option if you wish Translator++ to try to decrypt them.":19,"This may not work on some projects.":20,"List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. You can drag to sort the list.":21,"Literal tags are the tags that will be escaped into Translator++ editor.":22,"<b>ruby l r</b> are mandatory.":23,"<b>[r]</b> Tags will be interpolated by Translator++ into a new line. So you don't need to write <b>[r]</b> explicitly.":24,"Kirikiri script (.ks) is heavily customizable and allows developers to create their own tags.":25,"Translator++ can handle standard tags such as character names that start with a sharp (#).":26,"However, Translator++ cannot handle custom tags created by developers.":27,"Therefore, you may need to define the tags and attributes that need to be translated and those that need to be marked as actor names.":28,"You might need to <input type=\"button\" value=\"extract your xp3 game\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.kagParser.utils.unpackXP3Dialog()\" /> and analyze the ks script inside it before starting the project.":29,"Create Project":30,"Pack a folder into xp3":31,"Select the target character encoding.<br />Most Japanese KAG games are written with SHIFT-JIS, but KAG actually has support for UTF16LE unicode. Many translators set the character encoding to UTF16LE so that the game is playable non-Japanese windows without locale emulator. And most importantly, can displays characters outside SHIFT-JIS such as \"café\".<br />By default Translator++ will write to its original character encoding.":32,"There are several ways to produce playable localized game for KAG. Please select one that suit your preference.":33},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/po/ExportImport.js":{"data":[["Select mode","모드 선택"],["Select how do you want to start your project. By selecting files or folders.","프로젝트를 시작할 방법을 선택하세요. 파일 또는 폴더를 선택하여."],["Select Folder","폴더 선택"],["Select the folder for processing. Translator++ will recursively retrieve the PO files from the specified folder.","처리할 폴더를 선택하세요. Translator++는 지정된 폴더에서 PO 파일을 재귀적으로 검색합니다."],["Select File","파일 선택"],["Select the files you want to process.","처리하려는 파일을 선택하세요."],["Filters","필터"],["Filter the file name with glob pattern. Default is <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>","파일 이름을 glob 패턴으로 필터링합니다. 기본값은 <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>입니다."],["All .po files in the selected folder and its subfolders.","선택한 폴더와 하위 폴더의 모든 .po 파일."],["All .mo files in the selected folder and its subfolders.","선택한 폴더와 하위 폴더의 모든 .mo 파일."],["PO Files","PO 파일"],["MO Files","MO 파일"],["You are about to export the translations as MO files.\n","번역을 MO 파일로 내보내려고 합니다.\n"],["- MO files are binary files that cannot be edited manually.\n","- MO 파일은 수동으로 편집할 수 없는 바이너리 파일입니다.\n"],["- Only translated entries are stored in MO files.\n","- MO 파일에는 번역된 항목만 저장됩니다.\n"],["Are you sure you want to proceed?","진행하시겠습니까?"],["PO / MO Files","PO / MO 파일"]],"context":[["tid/1174/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1196/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1223/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1233/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1267/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1277/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1317/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1327/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1335/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1340/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2342/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2509/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2534/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2550/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2558/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2747/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"ExportImport.js","dirname":"/addons/po","extension":".js","filename":"ExportImport.js","path":"/addons/po/ExportImport.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Select mode":0,"Select how do you want to start your project. By selecting files or folders.":1,"Select Folder":2,"Select the folder for processing. Translator++ will recursively retrieve the PO files from the specified folder.":3,"Select File":4,"Select the files you want to process.":5,"Filters":6,"Filter the file name with glob pattern. Default is <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>":7,"All .po files in the selected folder and its subfolders.":8,"All .mo files in the selected folder and its subfolders.":9,"PO Files":10,"MO Files":11,"You are about to export the translations as MO files.\n":12,"- MO files are binary files that cannot be edited manually.\n":13,"- Only translated entries are stored in MO files.\n":14,"Are you sure you want to proceed?":15,"PO / MO Files":16},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/po/PoParser.js":{"data":[[".po and .mo files are standard text-based and binary file formats used together for software localization, particularly in WordPress, to translate themes and plugins. The PO (Portable Object) file is human-readable text containing translations, while the MO (Machine Object) file is a compiled, machine-readable binary file used by software for faster loading.",".po 및 .mo 파일은 소프트웨어 현지화, 특히 WordPress에서 테마와 플러그인을 번역하는 데 함께 사용되는 표준 텍스트 기반 및 바이너리 파일 형식입니다. PO(Portable Object) 파일은 번역을 포함하는 사람이 읽을 수 있는 텍스트이며, MO(Machine Object) 파일은 소프트웨어가 더 빠르게 로드하기 위해 사용하는 컴파일된 기계 판독 가능한 바이너리 파일입니다."],["Start translation from PO (Portable Object) and MO (Machine Object) translation scripts","PO(Portable Object) 및 MO(Machine Object) 번역 스크립트에서 번역 시작"],["Create Project","프로젝트 생성"],["Select mode","모드 선택"],["Select how do you want to start your project. By selecting files or folders.","파일 또는 폴더를 선택하여 프로젝트를 시작하는 방법을 선택하세요."],["Select Folder","폴더 선택"],["Select the folder for processing. Translator++ will recursively retrieve the PO files from the specified folder.","처리할 폴더를 선택하세요. Translator++는 지정된 폴더에서 PO 파일을 재귀적으로 검색합니다."],["Select File","파일 선택"],["Select the files you want to process.","처리하려는 파일을 선택하세요."],["Filters","필터"],["Filter the file name with glob pattern. Default is <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>","파일 이름을 glob 패턴으로 필터링합니다. 기본값은 <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>입니다."],["All .po files in the selected folder and its subfolders.","선택한 폴더와 하위 폴더의 모든 .po 파일."],["All .mo files in the selected folder and its subfolders.","선택한 폴더와 하위 폴더의 모든 .mo 파일."],["ProjectTitle","프로젝트 제목"],["Your project title","프로젝트 제목을 입력하세요"]],"context":[["tid/907/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/951/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1028/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1488/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1510/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1537/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1547/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1580/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1590/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1623/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1633/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1641/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1646/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1681/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1691/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"PoParser.js","dirname":"/addons/po","extension":".js","filename":"PoParser.js","path":"/addons/po/PoParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{".po and .mo files are standard text-based and binary file formats used together for software localization, particularly in WordPress, to translate themes and plugins. The PO (Portable Object) file is human-readable text containing translations, while the MO (Machine Object) file is a compiled, machine-readable binary file used by software for faster loading.":0,"Start translation from PO (Portable Object) and MO (Machine Object) translation scripts":1,"Create Project":2,"Select mode":3,"Select how do you want to start your project. By selecting files or folders.":4,"Select Folder":5,"Select the folder for processing. Translator++ will recursively retrieve the PO files from the specified folder.":6,"Select File":7,"Select the files you want to process.":8,"Filters":9,"Filter the file name with glob pattern. Default is <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>":10,"All .po files in the selected folder and its subfolders.":11,"All .mo files in the selected folder and its subfolders.":12,"ProjectTitle":13,"Your project title":14},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/pylivemakerParser/plmUtils.js":{"data":[["Livemaker Game Extractor","Livemaker 게임 추출기"],["Half width character patch","반각 문자 패치"],["Patch half-width character","반각 문자 패치 적용"]],"context":[["tid/347/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/809/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate","tid/870/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1061/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"plmUtils.js","dirname":"/addons/pylivemakerParser","extension":".js","filename":"plmUtils.js","path":"/addons/pylivemakerParser/plmUtils.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Livemaker Game Extractor":0,"Half width character patch":1,"Patch half-width character":2},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/pylivemakerParser/pylivemakerparser.js":{"data":[["Livemaker engine has limitations regarding language support. It requires setting the Windows non-unicode system locale to Japanese to run LiveMaker and LiveNovel applications. Additionally, the engine is hardcoded to only use installed Windows system fonts that support Windows Shift-JIS (MS CP932), which means it may not supports other locales or encodings","Livemaker 엔진은 언어 지원에 제한이 있습니다. LiveMaker 및 LiveNovel 애플리케이션을 실행하려면 Windows 비유니코드 시스템 로캘을 일본어로 설정해야 합니다. 또한 엔진은 Windows Shift-JIS(MS CP932)를 지원하는 설치된 Windows 시스템 글꼴만 사용하도록 하드코딩되어 있어, 다른 로캘이나 인코딩을 지원하지 않을 수 있습니다."],["Next","다음"],["Unable to detect RPG Maker type!\nAre you sure the game is RPG Maker XP, VX or VX Ace?","RPG Maker 유형을 감지할 수 없습니다!\n게임이 RPG Maker XP, VX 또는 VX Ace인지 확인하세요."],["Create a new project","새 프로젝트 만들기"],["Invalid destination file:","잘못된 대상 파일:"],[" doesn't seems to be a LiveMaker game.","는 LiveMaker 게임으로 보이지 않습니다."]],"context":[["tid/5574/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/5684/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6243/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6541/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6626/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/6662/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"pylivemakerparser.js","dirname":"/addons/pylivemakerParser","extension":".js","filename":"pylivemakerparser.js","path":"/addons/pylivemakerParser/pylivemakerparser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Livemaker engine has limitations regarding language support. It requires setting the Windows non-unicode system locale to Japanese to run LiveMaker and LiveNovel applications. Additionally, the engine is hardcoded to only use installed Windows system fonts that support Windows Shift-JIS (MS CP932), which means it may not supports other locales or encodings":0,"Next":1,"Unable to detect RPG Maker type!\nAre you sure the game is RPG Maker XP, VX or VX Ace?":2,"Create a new project":3,"Invalid destination file:":4," doesn't seems to be a LiveMaker game.":5},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/renParser/renParser.js":{"data":[["Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.","개발 경로가 정의되지 않았습니다.\n게임을 한 번 주입하여 개발 경로를 생성해야 합니다."],["Decompile all rpyc files","모든 rpyc 파일 디컴파일"],["Attempt to decompile all rpyc files into .rpy.<br />Translator++ has its own decompiler. But it is reported that sometimes it fails to decompile some of the games created with Renpy 7. You can leave this field unchecked and decompile the game yourself with your own tools before starting a project.","모든 rpyc 파일을 .rpy로 디컴파일하려고 시도합니다.<br />Translator++에는 자체 디컴파일러가 있지만, Renpy 7로 생성된 일부 게임의 디컴파일에 실패한다는 보고가 있습니다. 이 항목을 체크하지 않고, 프로젝트를 시작하기 전에 자신의 도구로 게임을 직접 디컴파일할 수 있습니다."],["Overwrite rpy","rpy 덮어쓰기"],["If checked then the decompiler <b>will overwrite the existing uncompiled rpy files</b>.","체크하면 디컴파일러가 <b>기존의 디컴파일되지 않은 rpy 파일을 덮어씁니다</b>."],["Exclude command","명령 제외"],["This option will allow us to skip some command for being processed and translated","이 옵션은 일부 명령어를 처리 및 번역에서 건너뛰도록 합니다"],["Separate entries with a space","항목은 공백으로 구분하세요"],["For example, if you put <b>old</b> then all lines in rpy that started with <b>old</b> will be ignored","예를 들어, <b>old</b>를 입력하면 rpy에서 <b>old</b>로 시작하는 모든 줄이 무시됩니다"],["Are you sure want to start a project without decompiling the rpyc files?","rpyc 파일을 디컴파일하지 않고 프로젝트를 시작하시겠습니까?"],["The file you're selected is not a Ren'Py game executable file.\nDo you want to continue anyway?","선택한 파일은 Ren'Py 게임 실행 파일이 아닙니다.\n그래도 계속하시겠습니까?"],["Play last build","마지막 빌드 재생"],["Open Ren'Py documentation","Ren'Py 문서 열기"],["The option has been set to use the legacy parser.\nYou can switch back to the new parser anytime via option menu.","옵션이 레거시 파서 사용으로 설정되었습니다.\n옵션 메뉴를 통해 언제든지 새 파서로 전환할 수 있습니다."]],"context":[["tid/6255/type/StringLiteral","tid/11918/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10916/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10921/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10926/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10931/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10936/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10941/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10946/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10951/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11291/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11456/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11869/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11970/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/12146/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"renParser.js","dirname":"/addons/renParser","extension":".js","filename":"renParser.js","path":"/addons/renParser/renParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.":0,"Decompile all rpyc files":1,"Attempt to decompile all rpyc files into .rpy.<br />Translator++ has its own decompiler. But it is reported that sometimes it fails to decompile some of the games created with Renpy 7. You can leave this field unchecked and decompile the game yourself with your own tools before starting a project.":2,"Overwrite rpy":3,"If checked then the decompiler <b>will overwrite the existing uncompiled rpy files</b>.":4,"Exclude command":5,"This option will allow us to skip some command for being processed and translated":6,"Separate entries with a space":7,"For example, if you put <b>old</b> then all lines in rpy that started with <b>old</b> will be ignored":8,"Are you sure want to start a project without decompiling the rpyc files?":9,"The file you're selected is not a Ren'Py game executable file.\nDo you want to continue anyway?":10,"Play last build":11,"Open Ren'Py documentation":12,"The option has been set to use the legacy parser.\nYou can switch back to the new parser anytime via option menu.":13},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/resourceParser/ResourceParser.js":{"data":[["Windows binary file translator","Windows 바이너리 파일 번역기"],["Parsing Windows binary file with","Windows 바이너리 파일 파싱 중"],["Sellect supported files","지원되는 파일 선택"],["Select supported file type to translate.","번역할 지원 파일 유형을 선택하세요."],["Create a new project","새 프로젝트 생성"],["Please select a supported file to parse","파싱할 지원 파일을 선택해 주세요"],["Please enter your project title!","프로젝트 제목을 입력해 주세요!"]],"context":[["tid/4109/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4114/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4127/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4132/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4469/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4550/type/StringLiteral","tid/4600/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4661/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"ResourceParser.js","dirname":"/addons/resourceParser","extension":".js","filename":"ResourceParser.js","path":"/addons/resourceParser/ResourceParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Windows binary file translator":0,"Parsing Windows binary file with":1,"Sellect supported files":2,"Select supported file type to translate.":3,"Create a new project":4,"Please select a supported file to parse":5,"Please enter your project title!":6},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rm2k2k3/2k.js":{"data":[["Use Native RPG Player","네이티브 RPG 플레이어 사용"],["Use native RPG Player instead of Easy RPG Player","Easy RPG 플레이어 대신 네이티브 RPG 플레이어 사용"],["Use native RPG Player","네이티브 RPG 플레이어 사용"],["Target folder","대상 폴더"],["Select destination folder.","대상 폴더 선택"],["Install Easy RPG Player","Easy RPG Player 설치"],["Close","닫기"],["Install","설치"],["Process completed!","처리 완료!"],["RPG Maker 2000 & 2003 Parser with xmlTrans plugin.","xmlTrans 플러그인을 포함한 RPG Maker 2000 & 2003 파서."],["Play last build","최신 빌드 실행"],["Apply translation then play","번역 적용 후 실행"],["Setup Easy RPG in the current directory","현재 디렉토리에 Easy RPG 설정"]],"context":[["tid/164/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/174/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/184/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5955/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5960/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6034/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6151/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6202/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6393/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7198/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/8288/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8344/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8395/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"2k.js","dirname":"/addons/rm2k2k3","extension":".js","filename":"2k.js","path":"/addons/rm2k2k3/2k.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Use Native RPG Player":0,"Use native RPG Player instead of Easy RPG Player":1,"Use native RPG Player":2,"Target folder":3,"Select destination folder.":4,"Install Easy RPG Player":5,"Close":6,"Install":7,"Process completed!":8,"RPG Maker 2000 & 2003 Parser with xmlTrans plugin.":9,"Play last build":10,"Apply translation then play":11,"Setup Easy RPG in the current directory":12},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rm2k2k3/2knew.js":{"data":[["Start translation from RM2k / RM2k3 engine","RM2k / RM2k3 엔진에서 번역 시작"],["Create project","프로젝트 생성"],["Please select RPG Maker 2000/2003 game!","RPG Maker 2000/2003 게임을 선택해 주세요!"],["Unable to detect RPG Maker type!\nAre you sure the game is RPG Maker 2000 / 2003?","RPG Maker 유형을 감지할 수 없습니다!\n게임이 RPG Maker 2000 / 2003인지 확인해 주세요."]],"context":[["tid/3902/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3971/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4041/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4450/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"2knew.js","dirname":"/addons/rm2k2k3","extension":".js","filename":"2knew.js","path":"/addons/rm2k2k3/2knew.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Start translation from RM2k / RM2k3 engine":0,"Create project":1,"Please select RPG Maker 2000/2003 game!":2,"Unable to detect RPG Maker type!\nAre you sure the game is RPG Maker 2000 / 2003?":3},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rm2k2k3/utils.js":{"data":[["Target folder","대상 폴더"],["Select destination folder.","대상 폴더 선택."],["Install Easy RPG Player","Easy RPG Player 설치"],["Close","닫기"],["Install","설치"],["How to add a custom font.\n\nThe fonts must be placed in the Font folder of the game directory and must be named Font.ttf or Font2.ttf. Which font file is used depends on the system graphic font setting. Besides ttf, fon and many other fonts are supported (anything supported by FreeType, the best open source library available for font rendering).\n\nSource: https://blog.easyrpg.org/2023/04/easyrpg-player-0-8-paralyze/","사용자 정의 글꼴 추가 방법.\n\n글꼴은 게임 디렉토리의 Font 폴더에 위치해야 하며 Font.ttf 또는 Font2.ttf로 이름 지어야 합니다. 사용되는 글꼴 파일은 시스템 그래픽 글꼴 설정에 따라 다릅니다. ttf 외에도 fon 및 기타 많은 글꼴이 지원됩니다 (FreeType, 글꼴 렌더링을 위한 최고의 오픈 소스 라이브러리에서 지원하는 모든 것).\n\n출처: https://blog.easyrpg.org/2023/04/easyrpg-player-0-8-paralyze/"],["Process completed!","처리 완료!"],["Play last build","최신 빌드 실행"],["Apply translation then play","번역 적용 후 재생"],["Setup Easy RPG in the current directory","현재 디렉토리에 Easy RPG 설정"]],"context":[["tid/934/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/939/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1013/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1130/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1181/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1402/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1450/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1743/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1796/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"utils.js","dirname":"/addons/rm2k2k3","extension":".js","filename":"utils.js","path":"/addons/rm2k2k3/utils.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Target folder":0,"Select destination folder.":1,"Install Easy RPG Player":2,"Close":3,"Install":4,"How to add a custom font.\n\nThe fonts must be placed in the Font folder of the game directory and must be named Font.ttf or Font2.ttf. Which font file is used depends on the system graphic font setting. Besides ttf, fon and many other fonts are supported (anything supported by FreeType, the best open source library available for font rendering).\n\nSource: https://blog.easyrpg.org/2023/04/easyrpg-player-0-8-paralyze/":5,"Process completed!":6,"Play last build":7,"Apply translation then play":8,"Setup Easy RPG in the current directory":9},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmmv/rmmv.js":{"data":[["Beautify JSON data","JSON 데이터 미화"],["When checked the generated data will be beautified.","체크 시 생성된 데이터가 미화됩니다."],["Error loading system.json","system.json 로딩 오류"],["Loading","로딩 중"],["index.html not found in","index.html을 찾을 수 없음:"],["Encrypted game","암호화된 게임"],["Select the index.html of your encrypted game.","암호화된 게임의 index.html을 선택하세요."],["Target folder","대상 폴더"],["Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.","대상 폴더를 선택하세요. 기존 파일이 대체됩니다."],["Decrypt Resources","리소스 복호화"],["Close","닫기"],["Process","처리"],["Source path can not empty","소스 경로는 비워둘 수 없습니다"],["Destination path can not empty","대상 경로는 비워둘 수 없습니다"],["Path is not a file:","경로가 파일이 아닙니다:"],["Invalid directory:","유효하지 않은 디렉토리:"],["Extract enigma","Enigma 추출"],["Select enigma file.","Enigma 파일을 선택하세요."],["Extract Enigma","엔그마 추출"],["Selected file is not an Enigma Virtual Box package.","선택한 파일은 엔그마 가상 박스 패키지가 아닙니다."],["Plugins are already fetched for this project. Want to re-fetch the plugins?","이 프로젝트에 대한 플러그인은 이미 가져왔습니다. 플러그인을 다시 가져오시겠습니까?"],["Translate Javascript File?","자바스크립트 파일 번역?"],["Cancel","취소"],["I know the risk, Proceed!","위험을 알고 있습니다, 진행합니다!"],["Game Executable Path","게임 실행 파일 경로"],["Path to the game executable file (.exe)","게임 실행 파일(.exe)의 경로"],["NWJS Version","NWJS 버전"],["Change into this NWJS version","이 NWJS 버전으로 변경"],["Use Developer version","개발자 버전 사용"],["Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.","NWJS 개발자 버전을 사용합니다. 개발자 버전은 개발자 도구를 사용할 수 있어 디버깅 및 개발에 적합합니다."],["In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.","개발자 버전에서는 <b>개발자 콘솔</b>을 사용할 수 있습니다. 개발자 콘솔은 F12를 누르거나 앱을 우클릭하여 '검사'를 선택하여 접근할 수 있습니다."],["Use 32-bit version","32비트 버전 사용"],["Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).","NWJS의 32비트 버전을 사용합니다. 32비트 버전은 오래된 시스템과의 호환성에 유용합니다. 가능하면 이 옵션을 선택 해제하는 것이 좋습니다(그냥 기기를 업그레이드하세요, 친구)."],["Some game feature may not work across NWJS version","일부 게임 기능은 NWJS 버전 간에 작동하지 않을 수 있음"],["Please be aware that some game feature may not work across NWJS version.","일부 게임 기능은 NWJS 버전 간에 작동하지 않을 수 있으니 주의하시기 바랍니다."],["Change RPG Maker MV / RPG Maker MZ / NWJS version","RPG Maker MV / RPG Maker MZ / NWJS 버전 변경"],["This operation will change the NW.js version into","이 작업은 NW.js 버전을 다음으로 변경합니다"],["Please close the application first before continuing.\nDo you want to continue?","계속하기 전에 먼저 애플리케이션을 닫아 주세요.\n계속하시겠습니까?"],["The selected file is not a valid NW.js application.","선택한 파일은 유효한 NW.js 애플리케이션이 아닙니다."],["Could not find index.html in the game directory.","게임 디렉토리에서 index.html을 찾을 수 없습니다."],["Debug menu script not found in addon directory.","애드온 디렉토리에서 디버그 메뉴 스크립트를 찾을 수 없습니다."],["Debug menu script is already installed in index.html.","index.html에 디버그 메뉴 스크립트가 이미 설치되어 있습니다."],["Debug options installed successfully!","디버그 옵션이 성공적으로 설치되었습니다!"],["The selected game is not running in NW.js Developer Mode (SDK).\n\n","선택한 게임이 NW.js 개발자 모드(SDK)에서 실행되고 있지 않습니다.\n\n"],["Developer Mode provides additional debugging features:\n","개발자 모드는 추가 디버깅 기능을 제공합니다:\n"],["• Developer Console (F12)\n","• 개발자 콘솔 (F12)\n"],["• Inspect Element (Right-click)\n","• 요소 검사 (우클릭)\n"],["• Network Monitor\n","• 네트워크 모니터\n"],["• Performance Profiler\n\n","• 성능 프로파일러\n\n"],["Do you want to upgrade to NW.js Developer Mode?\n","NW.js 개발자 모드로 업그레이드하시겠습니까?\n"],["(Recommended for better debugging experience)","(더 나은 디버깅 경험을 위해 권장됨)"],["The game will be upgraded to NW.js SDK version","게임이 NW.js SDK 버전으로 업그레이드됩니다"],["This may take a few minutes. Please wait...","몇 분 정도 걸릴 수 있습니다. 잠시 기다려 주세요..."],["NW.js has been upgraded to Developer Mode successfully!","NW.js가 개발자 모드로 성공적으로 업그레이드되었습니다!"],["Failed to upgrade to Developer Mode:\n","개발자 모드로 업그레이드하는 데 실패했습니다:\n"],["Error installing debug options: ","디버그 옵션 설치 오류: "],["Install Debug Options","디버그 옵션 설치"],["This will install a debug menu into your RPG Maker MV/MZ game.","이 기능은 RPG Maker MV/MZ 게임에 디버그 메뉴를 설치합니다."],["Select the game executable file to install debug options.","디버그 옵션을 설치할 게임 실행 파일을 선택하세요."],["Compile HTML to Executable","HTML을 실행 파일로 컴파일"],["Change Existing NWJS Version","기존 NWJS 버전 변경"],["Install debug options","디버그 옵션 설치"],["Find next","다음 찾기"],["Open folder","폴더 열기"],["Open with external application","외부 애플리케이션으로 열기"],["Raw JSON data. Right click to open menu.","원본 JSON 데이터. 마우스 오른쪽 클릭으로 메뉴를 열 수 있습니다."],["Patch is available for this trans data. This patch will make your trans data compatible with the current version of Translator++.\nDo you want to patch your Trans data?\n(Some feature may not work properly if you don't patch your trans data)","이 번역 데이터에 패치가 있습니다. 이 패치를 적용하면 현재 Translator++ 버전과 호환되도록 번역 데이터를 업데이트합니다.\n번역 데이터를 패치하시겠습니까?\n(패치하지 않으면 일부 기능이 제대로 작동하지 않을 수 있습니다)"],["Unable to locate executable to install debug options. Make sure your game is packaged for Windows with NW.js.","디버그 옵션을 설치할 실행 파일을 찾을 수 없습니다. 게임이 NW.js용으로 Windows용으로 패키징되어 있는지 확인하세요."],["Error while installing debug options: ","디버그 옵션 설치 중 오류 발생: "],["Play last build","마지막 빌드 재생"],["Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.","개발 경로가 정의되지 않았습니다.\n개발 경로를 생성하려면 게임을 한 번 주입해야 합니다."],["Open editor","에디터 열기"],["Load Plugins Into Project","프로젝트에 플러그인 로드"],["Compile Game","게임 컴파일"],["The option has been set to use the legacy parser.\nYou can switch back to the new parser anytime via option menu.","옵션이 레거시 파서 사용으로 설정되었습니다.\n옵션 메뉴를 통해 언제든지 새 파서로 전환할 수 있습니다."],["Unable to find the file related to the data","데이터와 관련된 파일을 찾을 수 없습니다"],["To fix this correct the <b>Raw material location</b> field at the <a href=\"#\" class=\"openProjectProperties\">Project properties</a>","이 문제를 해결하려면 <a href=\"#\" class=\"openProjectProperties\">프로젝트 속성</a>에서 <b>원본 자료 위치</b> 필드를 수정하세요."],["Maximum dialog line","최대 대화 줄"],["Maximum line in the dialog box. Default is 4.","대화 상자의 최대 줄 수. 기본값은 4입니다."],["Add debug options","디버그 옵션 추가"],["Add debug options into the game to help testing.","테스트를 돕기 위해 게임에 디버그 옵션을 추가합니다."],["Enable this option to add debugging tools to the game. These features can help you test your translation.<br/><b>⚠️ Note: This option is only available if your game is packaged with NWJS for Windows.</b>","이 옵션을 활성화하여 게임에 디버깅 도구를 추가합니다. 이 기능은 번역 테스트에 도움이 될 수 있습니다.<br/><b>⚠️ 참고: 이 옵션은 게임이 Windows용 NWJS로 패키징된 경우에만 사용 가능합니다.</b>"]],"context":[["tid/125/type/StringLiteral","tid/152/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/135/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/16151/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/19426/type/StringLiteral","tid/19469/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20448/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20619/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20624/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20635/type/StringLiteral","tid/21231/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20640/type/StringLiteral","tid/21236/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20713/type/StringLiteral","tid/30541/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20814/type/StringLiteral","tid/21410/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20865/type/StringLiteral","tid/21461/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20925/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20962/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20992/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21023/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21215/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21220/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21309/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21564/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21678/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22062/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22163/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22214/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22424/type/StringLiteral","tid/24166/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22434/type/StringLiteral","tid/24176/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22468/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22478/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22512/type/StringLiteral","tid/22962/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22522/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22533/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22560/type/StringLiteral","tid/22986/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22570/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22605/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/22610/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23014/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23119/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23148/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23298/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23453/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23555/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23696/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23770/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23812/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23820/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23828/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23836/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23844/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23852/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23860/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23868/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23922/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23931/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23972/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24005/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24068/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24217/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate","tid/24282/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/24222/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/24227/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/24482/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24546/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24598/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24781/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24891/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24981/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/25166/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/26021/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/29743/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/29779/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30242/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30291/type/StringLiteral","tid/30388/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30339/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30443/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30705/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30891/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/31622/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/31627/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/32659/type/StringLiteral","tid/32882/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/32669/type/StringLiteral","tid/32892/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/32935/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/32945/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/33021/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"rmmv.js","dirname":"/addons/rmmv","extension":".js","filename":"rmmv.js","path":"/addons/rmmv/rmmv.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Beautify JSON data":0,"When checked the generated data will be beautified.":1,"Error loading system.json":2,"Loading":3,"index.html not found in":4,"Encrypted game":5,"Select the index.html of your encrypted game.":6,"Target folder":7,"Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.":8,"Decrypt Resources":9,"Close":10,"Process":11,"Source path can not empty":12,"Destination path can not empty":13,"Path is not a file:":14,"Invalid directory:":15,"Extract enigma":16,"Select enigma file.":17,"Extract Enigma":18,"Selected file is not an Enigma Virtual Box package.":19,"Plugins are already fetched for this project. Want to re-fetch the plugins?":20,"Translate Javascript File?":21,"Cancel":22,"I know the risk, Proceed!":23,"Game Executable Path":24,"Path to the game executable file (.exe)":25,"NWJS Version":26,"Change into this NWJS version":27,"Use Developer version":28,"Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.":29,"In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.":30,"Use 32-bit version":31,"Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).":32,"Some game feature may not work across NWJS version":33,"Please be aware that some game feature may not work across NWJS version.":34,"Change RPG Maker MV / RPG Maker MZ / NWJS version":35,"This operation will change the NW.js version into":36,"Please close the application first before continuing.\nDo you want to continue?":37,"The selected file is not a valid NW.js application.":38,"Could not find index.html in the game directory.":39,"Debug menu script not found in addon directory.":40,"Debug menu script is already installed in index.html.":41,"Debug options installed successfully!":42,"The selected game is not running in NW.js Developer Mode (SDK).\n\n":43,"Developer Mode provides additional debugging features:\n":44,"• Developer Console (F12)\n":45,"• Inspect Element (Right-click)\n":46,"• Network Monitor\n":47,"• Performance Profiler\n\n":48,"Do you want to upgrade to NW.js Developer Mode?\n":49,"(Recommended for better debugging experience)":50,"The game will be upgraded to NW.js SDK version":51,"This may take a few minutes. Please wait...":52,"NW.js has been upgraded to Developer Mode successfully!":53,"Failed to upgrade to Developer Mode:\n":54,"Error installing debug options: ":55,"Install Debug Options":56,"This will install a debug menu into your RPG Maker MV/MZ game.":57,"Select the game executable file to install debug options.":58,"Compile HTML to Executable":59,"Change Existing NWJS Version":60,"Install debug options":61,"Find next":62,"Open folder":63,"Open with external application":64,"Raw JSON data. Right click to open menu.":65,"Patch is available for this trans data. This patch will make your trans data compatible with the current version of Translator++.\nDo you want to patch your Trans data?\n(Some feature may not work properly if you don't patch your trans data)":66,"Unable to locate executable to install debug options. Make sure your game is packaged for Windows with NW.js.":67,"Error while installing debug options: ":68,"Play last build":69,"Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.":70,"Open editor":71,"Load Plugins Into Project":72,"Compile Game":73,"The option has been set to use the legacy parser.\nYou can switch back to the new parser anytime via option menu.":74,"Unable to find the file related to the data":75,"To fix this correct the <b>Raw material location</b> field at the <a href=\"#\" class=\"openProjectProperties\">Project properties</a>":76,"Maximum dialog line":77,"Maximum line in the dialog box. Default is 4.":78,"Add debug options":79,"Add debug options into the game to help testing.":80,"Enable this option to add debugging tools to the game. These features can help you test your translation.<br/><b>⚠️ Note: This option is only available if your game is packaged with NWJS for Windows.</b>":81},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmmv/src/dv-debugmenu-map-preview.js":{"data":[["This feature only available if you are using Developer version of NWJS.","이 기능은 NWJS 개발자 버전을 사용 중일 때만 사용 가능합니다."]],"context":[["tid/19679/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"dv-debugmenu-map-preview.js","dirname":"/addons/rmmv/src","extension":".js","filename":"dv-debugmenu-map-preview.js","path":"/addons/rmmv/src/dv-debugmenu-map-preview.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"This feature only available if you are using Developer version of NWJS.":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmmv/src/dv-debugmenu.js":{"data":[["This feature only available if you are using developer version of NW.js.","이 기능은 NW.js 개발자 버전을 사용 중일 때만 사용 가능합니다."]],"context":[["tid/22924/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"dv-debugmenu.js","dirname":"/addons/rmmv/src","extension":".js","filename":"dv-debugmenu.js","path":"/addons/rmmv/src/dv-debugmenu.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"This feature only available if you are using developer version of NW.js.":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmrgss/RMUtil.js":{"data":[["Use legacy parser","레거시 파서 사용"],["Use the old parser prior to (Translator++ ver. 3.8.12). The old parser doesn't support some newly added features.","(Translator++ ver. 3.8.12 이전)의 구형 파서를 사용합니다. 구형 파서는 일부 새로 추가된 기능을 지원하지 않습니다."],["Use old parser","구형 파서 사용"],["Event's thread concurrency","이벤트의 스레드 동시성"],["<b>Warning! Experimental feature!</b><br />This option determines the maximum number of worker threads that can concurrently parse event data on the Map and CommonEvents. <b>Set to 0 to disable worker thread</b>. <br />This option has the potential to accelerate the parsing process in larger games. However, it is important to note that in smaller games, enabling this option may actually slow down the parsing process due to the higher execution overhead compared to the parsing time for each data.","<b>경고! 실험적 기능입니다!</b><br />이 옵션은 맵과 공통 이벤트에서 이벤트 데이터를 동시에 파싱할 수 있는 최대 작업자 스레드 수를 결정합니다. <b>작업자 스레드를 비활성화하려면 0으로 설정하세요</b>. <br />이 옵션은 대규모 게임에서 파싱 과정을 가속화할 수 있습니다. 그러나 작은 게임에서는 각 데이터의 파싱 시간에 비해 실행 오버헤드가 높아 이 옵션을 활성화하면 오히려 파싱 과정이 느려질 수 있습니다."],["The minimum number of command in an event that allowed in thread worker","스레드 작업자에서 허용되는 이벤트의 최소 명령어 수"],["<b>Warning! Experimental feature!</b><br />Thread workers incur overhead during execution, which means that processing blank events or events with a low number of commands can actually hinder the overall process. This option enables you to specify the minimum number of commands an event must have in order to be parsed in a worker thread. <br />It is important to note that even blank events contain one command, and it is more efficient to process such events in the main thread rather than in a worker thread. Therefore, it is recommended to set this number to a value <b>greater than 1</b>.<br />Set to 0 to disable splitting task based on commands.","<b>경고! 실험적 기능입니다!</b><br />스레드 작업자는 실행 중 오버헤드가 발생하며, 이는 빈 이벤트나 적은 명령어 수의 이벤트를 처리하면 전체 과정이 방해될 수 있음을 의미합니다. 이 옵션을 사용하면 작업자 스레드에서 파싱하기 위해 이벤트가 가져야 하는 최소 명령어 수를 지정할 수 있습니다. <br />빈 이벤트도 실제로 하나의 명령어를 포함하며, 이러한 이벤트는 작업자 스레드보다 메인 스레드에서 처리하는 것이 더 효율적입니다. 따라서 이 숫자를 <b>1보다 큰 값</b>으로 설정하는 것이 권장됩니다.<br />명령어 기반 작업 분할을 비활성화하려면 0으로 설정하세요."],["Note that a blank event actually contains one command, and you definitely want to process blank events in the main thread instead of a worker thread. You should set this number to a value greater than 1.","빈 이벤트는 실제로 하나의 명령어를 포함하며, 빈 이벤트는 작업자 스레드 대신 메인 스레드에서 처리하는 것이 확실히 바람직합니다. 이 숫자를 1보다 큰 값으로 설정해야 합니다."],["RPG Maker XP, VX, Ace, MV & MZ Parser V.3","RPG Maker XP, VX, Ace, MV & MZ 파서 V.3"],["Start translation from RPG Maker game using the latest parser.","최신 파서를 사용하여 RPG Maker 게임 번역을 시작합니다."],["Error!\r\nTranslator++ is unable to detect the type of ","오류!\r\nTranslator++가 유형을 감지할 수 없습니다."],["You should change the path!\r\nThe Dev directory should not inside the original game's directory, as this will cause problem if you inject the game latter.","경로를 변경해야 합니다!\r\n개발 디렉토리는 원본 게임 디렉토리 내에 있으면 안 되며, 이는 나중에 게임을 주입할 때 문제를 일으킬 수 있습니다."],["The game is packed with Enigma.\r\nDo you want to extract the package?\r\nThis will take minutes, depend on the size of your game.","게임이 Enigma로 패키징되었습니다.\r\n패키지를 추출하시겠습니까?\r\n게임 크기에 따라 몇 분이 소요됩니다."],["Unable to extract the Enigma package!","Enigma 패키지를 추출할 수 없습니다!"],["Copy & extract data into ","데이터를 복사 및 추출하여 "]],"context":[["tid/263/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/273/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/290/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/344/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/354/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/424/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/434/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/438/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21951/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21956/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22453/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22989/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23038/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23126/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23333/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"RMUtil.js","dirname":"/addons/rmrgss","extension":".js","filename":"RMUtil.js","path":"/addons/rmrgss/RMUtil.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Use legacy parser":0,"Use the old parser prior to (Translator++ ver. 3.8.12). The old parser doesn't support some newly added features.":1,"Use old parser":2,"Event's thread concurrency":3,"<b>Warning! Experimental feature!</b><br />This option determines the maximum number of worker threads that can concurrently parse event data on the Map and CommonEvents. <b>Set to 0 to disable worker thread</b>. <br />This option has the potential to accelerate the parsing process in larger games. However, it is important to note that in smaller games, enabling this option may actually slow down the parsing process due to the higher execution overhead compared to the parsing time for each data.":4,"The minimum number of command in an event that allowed in thread worker":5,"<b>Warning! Experimental feature!</b><br />Thread workers incur overhead during execution, which means that processing blank events or events with a low number of commands can actually hinder the overall process. This option enables you to specify the minimum number of commands an event must have in order to be parsed in a worker thread. <br />It is important to note that even blank events contain one command, and it is more efficient to process such events in the main thread rather than in a worker thread. Therefore, it is recommended to set this number to a value <b>greater than 1</b>.<br />Set to 0 to disable splitting task based on commands.":6,"Note that a blank event actually contains one command, and you definitely want to process blank events in the main thread instead of a worker thread. You should set this number to a value greater than 1.":7,"RPG Maker XP, VX, Ace, MV & MZ Parser V.3":8,"Start translation from RPG Maker game using the latest parser.":9,"Error!\r\nTranslator++ is unable to detect the type of ":10,"You should change the path!\r\nThe Dev directory should not inside the original game's directory, as this will cause problem if you inject the game latter.":11,"The game is packed with Enigma.\r\nDo you want to extract the package?\r\nThis will take minutes, depend on the size of your game.":12,"Unable to extract the Enigma package!":13,"Copy & extract data into ":14},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmrgss/legacyHandler.js":{"data":[["RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is needed to run this action.\nRPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is licensed under GPL-3 and cannot be distributed along with the program.\nBut Translator++ can set it up on your behalf.\n\nDo you wan't Translator++ to install RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway for you?","이 작업을 실행하려면 RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway가 필요합니다.\nRPGMakertrans CLI Gateway는 GPL-3 라이선스로 배포되어 프로그램과 함께 배포할 수 없습니다.\n하지만 Translator++가 대신 설치해 드릴 수 있습니다.\n\nTranslator++가 RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway를 설치하도록 하시겠습니까?"],["RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is need to be updated.\nDo you wan't Translator++ to update the RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway for you?","RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway를 업데이트해야 합니다.\nTranslator++가 RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway를 업데이트하도록 하시겠습니까?"],["Maximum dialog line","대화 최대 줄"],["Maximum line in the dialog box. Default is 4.","대화 상자의 최대 줄 수입니다. 기본값은 4입니다."]],"context":[["tid/569/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/644/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4420/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4430/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"legacyHandler.js","dirname":"/addons/rmrgss","extension":".js","filename":"legacyHandler.js","path":"/addons/rmrgss/legacyHandler.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is needed to run this action.\nRPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is licensed under GPL-3 and cannot be distributed along with the program.\nBut Translator++ can set it up on your behalf.\n\nDo you wan't Translator++ to install RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway for you?":0,"RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is need to be updated.\nDo you wan't Translator++ to update the RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway for you?":1,"Maximum dialog line":2,"Maximum line in the dialog box. Default is 4.":3},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/srpgStudioParser/srpgstudio.js":{"data":[["Start a translation project from SRPG Studio Engine.","SRPG Studio 엔진에서 번역 프로젝트를 시작합니다."],["The parser can handle translation from <b>data.dts</b> (srpgs file); the <b>localization.dat</b> file and localization files (.json, .txt, .js) generated by SRPG Studio's localization tool introduced in version 1.253..","파서는 <b>data.dts</b> (srpgs 파일)의 번역을 처리할 수 있으며, SRPG Studio 버전 1.253에서 소개된 현지화 도구로 생성된 <b>localization.dat</b> 파일 및 현지화 파일(.json, .txt, .js)도 처리할 수 있습니다."],["Create project","프로젝트 생성"],["Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!","오류: customField가 정의되지 않았습니다. 이는 발생해서는 안 됩니다!"],["Please select the entry point to translate.","번역할 진입점을 선택해 주세요."],["There are currently two known locations of translatable text within the SRPG Studio game. <br />","현재 SRPG Studio 게임 내 번역 가능한 텍스트의 위치는 두 가지로 알려져 있습니다. <br />"],["The first is directly written inside the .srpgs file, and the second is in the localization.dat file. This parser can currently can handle both.","첫 번째는 .srpgs 파일에 직접 기록된 텍스트이고, 두 번째는 localization.dat 파일에 있습니다. 이 파서는 현재 둘 다 처리할 수 있습니다."],["<br />In addition to that, you can also translate the localization files generated by SRPG Studio's localization tool. These files are in JSON, TXT, and JS format.","<br />또한, SRPG Studio의 현지화 도구로 생성된 현지화 파일도 번역할 수 있습니다. 이러한 파일은 JSON, TXT, JS 형식입니다."]],"context":[["tid/2574/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2579/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2648/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2745/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3047/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3054/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3061/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"srpgstudio.js","dirname":"/addons/srpgStudioParser","extension":".js","filename":"srpgstudio.js","path":"/addons/srpgStudioParser/srpgstudio.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Start a translation project from SRPG Studio Engine.":0,"The parser can handle translation from <b>data.dts</b> (srpgs file); the <b>localization.dat</b> file and localization files (.json, .txt, .js) generated by SRPG Studio's localization tool introduced in version 1.253..":1,"Create project":2,"Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!":3,"Please select the entry point to translate.":4,"There are currently two known locations of translatable text within the SRPG Studio game. <br />":5,"The first is directly written inside the .srpgs file, and the second is in the localization.dat file. This parser can currently can handle both.":6,"<br />In addition to that, you can also translate the localization files generated by SRPG Studio's localization tool. These files are in JSON, TXT, and JS format.":7},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/srpgStudioParserAlt/srpgstudio-alt.js":{"data":[["Parse SRPG Studio archives and translation dump JSON generated by SRPG_Unpacker.exe.","SRPG Studio 아카이브와 SRPG_Unpacker.exe로 생성된 번역 덤프 JSON을 파싱합니다."],["Start translation from SRPG Studio data.dts, project.dat, or translation dump JSON.<br />This is the latest parser—significantly faster and more stable—which will replace the previous version.","SRPG Studio data.dts, project.dat 또는 번역 덤프 JSON에서 번역을 시작합니다.<br />이것은 이전 버전을 대체할 최신 파서로, 훨씬 빠르고 안정적입니다."],["Create Project","프로젝트 생성"],["Source mode","소스 모드"],["Choose EXE mode to start from the game executable, archive mode for data.dts / project.dat, or dump mode for translation dump JSON.","게임 실행 파일에서 시작하려면 EXE 모드를, data.dts / project.dat에서는 아카이브 모드를, 번역 덤프 JSON에서는 덤프 모드를 선택하세요."],["Select executable","실행 파일 선택"],["Select the game executable. Translator++ will look for data.dts in the same folder.","게임 실행 파일을 선택하세요. Translator++는 동일한 폴더에서 data.dts를 찾습니다."],["Select archive file","아카이브 파일 선택"],["Select data.dts directly.","data.dts 파일 직접 선택"],["Select dump folder","덤프 폴더 선택"],["Select the translation dump folder generated by SRPG_Unpacker.exe.","SRPG_Unpacker.exe로 생성된 번역 덤프 폴더를 선택하세요."],["Filters","필터"],["Glob pattern used to select JSON files from the dump folder.","덤프 폴더에서 JSON 파일을 선택하는 데 사용되는 글로브 패턴입니다."],["ProjectTitle","프로젝트 제목"],["Your project title","프로젝트 제목을 입력하세요"]],"context":[["tid/4165/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4208/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4279/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4550/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4582/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4608/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4618/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4651/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4661/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4694/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4704/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4737/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4747/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4780/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4790/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"srpgstudio-alt.js","dirname":"/addons/srpgStudioParserAlt","extension":".js","filename":"srpgstudio-alt.js","path":"/addons/srpgStudioParserAlt/srpgstudio-alt.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Parse SRPG Studio archives and translation dump JSON generated by SRPG_Unpacker.exe.":0,"Start translation from SRPG Studio data.dts, project.dat, or translation dump JSON.<br />This is the latest parser—significantly faster and more stable—which will replace the previous version.":1,"Create Project":2,"Source mode":3,"Choose EXE mode to start from the game executable, archive mode for data.dts / project.dat, or dump mode for translation dump JSON.":4,"Select executable":5,"Select the game executable. Translator++ will look for data.dts in the same folder.":6,"Select archive file":7,"Select data.dts directly.":8,"Select dump folder":9,"Select the translation dump folder generated by SRPG_Unpacker.exe.":10,"Filters":11,"Glob pattern used to select JSON files from the dump folder.":12,"ProjectTitle":13,"Your project title":14},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/sugoiTrans/serverManager.html":{"data":[["Sugoi translator location <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Point to the .bat file or .exe file on the root directory of the application.\"></i>","스고이 번역기 위치 <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"애플리케이션 루트 디렉토리의 .bat 파일 또는 .exe 파일을 가리킵니다.\"></i>"],["<i class=\"icon-attention red\"></i> Invalid path.<br>Some features will be disabled until this is fixed.","<i class=\"icon-attention red\"></i> 잘못된 경로입니다.<br>이 문제가 해결될 때까지 일부 기능이 비활성화됩니다."],["Server Type :","서버 유형 :"],["Installed Model :","설치된 모델 :"],["Install Sugoi Translator","스고이 번역기 설치"],["Don't have Sugoi Translator?\n            Install customized &amp; optimized Sugoi Translator server now!\n        ","스고이 번역기가 없으신가요?\n            지금 맞춤형 및 최적화된 스고이 번역기 서버를 설치하세요!\n        "],["Number of server to start (CPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Number of server started simultaneously\"></i>","시작할 서버 수 (CPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"동시에 시작되는 서버 수\"></i>"],["Number of server to be started simultaneously.<br>More process desn't always means more speed, be mindful of your RAM &amp; CPU capacity.<br>You may won't get the benefit if by running just one server the CPU usage has reached 100%","동시에 시작될 서버 수입니다.<br>더 많은 프로세스가 항상 더 빠른 속도를 의미하지는 않으며, RAM 및 CPU 용량을 고려하세요.<br>단일 서버 실행 시 CPU 사용률이 100%에 도달한다면 이점을 얻지 못할 수 있습니다."],["\n                    Your Sugoi Translator doesn't support GPU processing.<br>\n                    You need to patch your server to support GPU processing.<br>\n                    <h3 data-tran=\"\">Select the following option to install the suitable patch for your system</h3>\n                    <div>\n                        <span data-tran=\"\">Your GPU is:</span>\n                        <ul class=\"gpuList\"></ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"gpuPatchOptions\">\n                        <button class=\"patchGPU\" data-tran=\"\">Install patch For NVIDIA series 30xx or greater</button>\n                        <button class=\"patchGPULegacy\" data-tran=\"\">Install patch For NVIDIA series 20xx or lower</button>\n    \n                    </div>\n                ","\n                    귀하의 스고이 번역기는 GPU 처리를 지원하지 않습니다.<br>\n                    GPU 처리를 지원하려면 서버에 패치를 적용해야 합니다.<br>\n                    <h3 data-tran=\"\">시스템에 적합한 패치를 설치하려면 다음 옵션을 선택하세요</h3>\n                    <div>\n                        <span data-tran=\"\">귀하의 GPU는:</span>\n                        <ul class=\"gpuList\"></ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"gpuPatchOptions\">\n                        <button class=\"patchGPU\" data-tran=\"\">NVIDIA 시리즈 30xx 이상용 패치 설치</button>\n                        <button class=\"patchGPULegacy\" data-tran=\"\">NVIDIA 시리즈 20xx 이하용 패치 설치</button>\n    \n                    </div>\n                "],["Select the following option to install the suitable patch for your system","시스템에 적합한 패치를 설치하려면 다음 옵션을 선택하세요"],["Your GPU is:","귀하의 GPU는:"],["Install patch For NVIDIA series 30xx or greater","NVIDIA 시리즈 30xx 이상용 패치 설치"],["Install patch For NVIDIA series 20xx or lower","NVIDIA 시리즈 20xx 이하용 패치 설치"],["Number of server to start (GPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Number of server started simultaneously using GPU. Your server must be patched to enable GPU processing.\"></i>","시작할 서버 수 (GPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"GPU를 사용하여 동시에 시작된 서버 수. GPU 처리를 활성화하려면 서버를 패치해야 합니다.\"></i>"],["How many server do you want to start on your <b>GPU</b>. It is possible to run both CPU and GPU based service simultaneously. But please keep in mind that if your CPU usage is high it may hinder the GPU performance.<br>Your server must be patched to enable this mode.","<b>GPU</b>에서 시작할 서버 수. CPU 및 GPU 기반 서비스를 동시에 실행할 수 있습니다. 그러나 CPU 사용량이 높으면 GPU 성능에 방해가 될 수 있으니 주의하세요.<br>이 모드를 활성화하려면 서버를 패치해야 합니다."],["Starting port number","시작 포트 번호"],["The port numbers will be generated incrementaly starting from the value below","아래 값부터 포트 번호가 순차적으로 생성됩니다"],["Keep console window open","콘솔 창 열어 두기"],["prevent console window from closing when the server closes. This option is useful for checking for errors that caused the server to crash.","서버가 닫힐 때 콘솔 창이 닫히지 않도록 합니다. 이 옵션은 서버 충돌을 일으킨 오류를 확인하는 데 유용합니다."],["Action","작업"],["Set Sugoi Trans config based on this setting","이 설정을 기반으로 Sugoi Trans 구성 설정"],["Start All Server","모든 서버 시작"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/3/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText","idx/6/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/9/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/16/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"]],"basename":"serverManager.html","dirname":"/addons/sugoiTrans","extension":".html","filename":"serverManager.html","path":"/addons/sugoiTrans/serverManager.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Sugoi translator location <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Point to the .bat file or .exe file on the root directory of the application.\"></i>":0,"<i class=\"icon-attention red\"></i> Invalid path.<br>Some features will be disabled until this is fixed.":1,"Server Type :":2,"Installed Model :":3,"Install Sugoi Translator":4,"Don't have Sugoi Translator?\n            Install customized &amp; optimized Sugoi Translator server now!\n        ":5,"Number of server to start (CPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Number of server started simultaneously\"></i>":6,"Number of server to be started simultaneously.<br>More process desn't always means more speed, be mindful of your RAM &amp; CPU capacity.<br>You may won't get the benefit if by running just one server the CPU usage has reached 100%":7,"\n                    Your Sugoi Translator doesn't support GPU processing.<br>\n                    You need to patch your server to support GPU processing.<br>\n                    <h3 data-tran=\"\">Select the following option to install the suitable patch for your system</h3>\n                    <div>\n                        <span data-tran=\"\">Your GPU is:</span>\n                        <ul class=\"gpuList\"></ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"gpuPatchOptions\">\n                        <button class=\"patchGPU\" data-tran=\"\">Install patch For NVIDIA series 30xx or greater</button>\n                        <button class=\"patchGPULegacy\" data-tran=\"\">Install patch For NVIDIA series 20xx or lower</button>\n    \n                    </div>\n                ":8,"Select the following option to install the suitable patch for your system":9,"Your GPU is:":10,"Install patch For NVIDIA series 30xx or greater":11,"Install patch For NVIDIA series 20xx or lower":12,"Number of server to start (GPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Number of server started simultaneously using GPU. Your server must be patched to enable GPU processing.\"></i>":13,"How many server do you want to start on your <b>GPU</b>. It is possible to run both CPU and GPU based service simultaneously. But please keep in mind that if your CPU usage is high it may hinder the GPU performance.<br>Your server must be patched to enable this mode.":14,"Starting port number":15,"The port numbers will be generated incrementaly starting from the value below":16,"Keep console window open":17,"prevent console window from closing when the server closes. This option is useful for checking for errors that caused the server to crash.":18,"Action":19,"Set Sugoi Trans config based on this setting":20,"Start All Server":21},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/sugoiTrans/serverManager.js":{"data":[["Select installation folder","설치 폴더 선택"],["Where do you want to install the CT2 Sugoi Translator into?","CT2 Sugoi Translator를 어디에 설치하시겠습니까?"],["Cancel","취소"],["Install now!","지금 설치!"],["Path to the directory can not be empty!","디렉토리 경로는 비워둘 수 없습니다!"],["Invalid directory:","잘못된 디렉토리:"],["Failed to download file. Repository do not exist. Please see the console log for more information.","파일 다운로드 실패. 저장소가 존재하지 않습니다. 자세한 내용은 콘솔 로그를 확인하세요."],["Are you sure want to update your server?\nThis update script will work for NVIDIA 3XXX series","서버를 업데이트하시겠습니까?\n이 업데이트 스크립트는 NVIDIA 3XXX 시리즈용입니다"],["Are you sure want to update your server?\nThis update script will work for NVIDIA 2XXX series and earlier","서버를 업데이트하시겠습니까?\n이 업데이트 스크립트는 NVIDIA 2XXX 시리즈 및 이전 버전용입니다"],["Install CT2 Sugoi Translator","CT2 Sugoi Translator 설치"],["Installation completed\nDo you want to set the Server Manager with this installed server?","설치 완료\n이 설치된 서버로 서버 관리자를 설정하시겠습니까?"],["Sugoi Translator Installed","스고이 번역기 설치됨"],["Server started\nPlease wait until the server(s) are ready before you translate things.","서버 시작됨\n번역을 시작하기 전에 서버(들)가 준비될 때까지 기다려 주세요."],["This action will overwrite the current value of Sugoi Trans Addon's settings.\nAre you sure?","이 작업은 스고이 번역 추가 기능 설정의 현재 값을 덮어씁니다.\n확실하신가요?"],["Do you want to reset the current configuration?","현재 구성을 초기화하시겠습니까?"],["Configuration refreshed!","구성 새로 고침 완료!"]],"context":[["tid/528/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate","tid/635/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/533/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/766/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/817/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/900/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/929/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1552/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6226/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/6296/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/8731/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8957/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9003/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9606/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9643/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/9713/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9778/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"serverManager.js","dirname":"/addons/sugoiTrans","extension":".js","filename":"serverManager.js","path":"/addons/sugoiTrans/serverManager.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Select installation folder":0,"Where do you want to install the CT2 Sugoi Translator into?":1,"Cancel":2,"Install now!":3,"Path to the directory can not be empty!":4,"Invalid directory:":5,"Failed to download file. Repository do not exist. Please see the console log for more information.":6,"Are you sure want to update your server?\nThis update script will work for NVIDIA 3XXX series":7,"Are you sure want to update your server?\nThis update script will work for NVIDIA 2XXX series and earlier":8,"Install CT2 Sugoi Translator":9,"Installation completed\nDo you want to set the Server Manager with this installed server?":10,"Sugoi Translator Installed":11,"Server started\nPlease wait until the server(s) are ready before you translate things.":12,"This action will overwrite the current value of Sugoi Trans Addon's settings.\nAre you sure?":13,"Do you want to reset the current configuration?":14,"Configuration refreshed!":15},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/sugoiTrans/sugoiTrans.js":{"data":[["Line delimiter","줄 구분자"],["Fill in with the characters or phrases that will be escaped by the translator (the original phrase and the translation will always be the same). This will guarantee that the number of lines of the translated text is the same as the number of lines of the original text. \nThere are currently no phrases/characters that Sugoi will escape with a 100% success rate.\nYou can try using &#x3C;br&#x3E; with decent amount of success rate.\nLeave blank if you want to concatenate the lines into a single line.","번역기에 의해 이스케이프될 문자나 구문을 입력하세요(원래 구문과 번역이 항상 동일합니다). 이렇게 하면 번역된 텍스트의 줄 수가 원본 텍스트의 줄 수와 같도록 보장됩니다.\n현재 스고이가 100% 성공률로 이스케이프할 구문/문자가 없습니다.\n&#x3C;br&#x3E;를 사용하면 꽤 높은 성공률을 얻을 수 있습니다.\n줄을 하나의 줄로 연결하려면 비워 두세요."],["Target URL(s)","대상 URL(들)"],["Translator target URL. You can enter one ore more Sugoi Translator back-end URL. Translator++ will load balance the request across all instance of the services. Separate each entry with a new line.","번역기 대상 URL. 하나 이상의 스고이 번역기 백엔드 URL을 입력할 수 있습니다. Translator++는 모든 서비스 인스턴스에 걸쳐 요청을 로드 밸런싱합니다. 각 항목은 새 줄로 구분하세요."],["Max Parallel job","최대 병렬 작업"],["Maximum parallel job that run simultaneously.","동시에 실행되는 최대 병렬 작업 수입니다."],["Send requests in batch","요청을 일괄 전송"],["Send several texts (by Max Parallel job) in array.\nFaster and can cut the execution overhead significantly. You must run the server from server manager to enable this option.","여러 텍스트(최대 병렬 작업 수만큼)를 배열로 전송합니다.\n더 빠르며 실행 오버헤드를 크게 줄일 수 있습니다. 이 옵션을 활성화하려면 서버 관리자에서 서버를 실행해야 합니다."],["Check First Line in Common Reference","공통 참조에서 첫 줄 확인"],["Do not include first line in the payload if the first line is found at Common Reference.\nThis is very useful if the character name is at the first line.","첫 줄이 공통 참조에 있으면 페이로드에 포함하지 않습니다.\n캐릭터 이름이 첫 줄에 있을 때 매우 유용합니다."],["Check Last Line in Common Reference","공통 참조에서 마지막 줄 확인"],["Do not include last line in the payload if the last line is found at Common Reference.\nThis is very useful if the character name is at the last line.","마지막 줄이 공통 참조에 있으면 페이로드에 포함하지 않습니다.\n캐릭터 이름이 마지막 줄에 있을 때 매우 유용합니다."],["Automatic splitting","자동 분할"],["Automatically split the translation into the number of lines matching the original. The length of each line will be of a similar size.","번역을 원본과 일치하는 줄 수로 자동 분할합니다. 각 줄의 길이는 비슷한 크기가 됩니다."],["Code Escaping Algorithm","코드 이스케이프 알고리즘"],["Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues (not yet implemented, please wait for the future updates)","대화 내 인라인 코드를 위한 이스케이프 알고리즘 (아직 구현되지 않았습니다. 향후 업데이트를 기다려 주세요)"]],"context":[["tid/161/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/171/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/203/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/213/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/257/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/267/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/305/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/315/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/347/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/357/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/389/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/399/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/431/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/441/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/473/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/483/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"sugoiTrans.js","dirname":"/addons/sugoiTrans","extension":".js","filename":"sugoiTrans.js","path":"/addons/sugoiTrans/sugoiTrans.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Line delimiter":0,"Fill in with the characters or phrases that will be escaped by the translator (the original phrase and the translation will always be the same). This will guarantee that the number of lines of the translated text is the same as the number of lines of the original text. \nThere are currently no phrases/characters that Sugoi will escape with a 100% success rate.\nYou can try using &#x3C;br&#x3E; with decent amount of success rate.\nLeave blank if you want to concatenate the lines into a single line.":1,"Target URL(s)":2,"Translator target URL. You can enter one ore more Sugoi Translator back-end URL. Translator++ will load balance the request across all instance of the services. Separate each entry with a new line.":3,"Max Parallel job":4,"Maximum parallel job that run simultaneously.":5,"Send requests in batch":6,"Send several texts (by Max Parallel job) in array.\nFaster and can cut the execution overhead significantly. You must run the server from server manager to enable this option.":7,"Check First Line in Common Reference":8,"Do not include first line in the payload if the first line is found at Common Reference.\nThis is very useful if the character name is at the first line.":9,"Check Last Line in Common Reference":10,"Do not include last line in the payload if the last line is found at Common Reference.\nThis is very useful if the character name is at the last line.":11,"Automatic splitting":12,"Automatically split the translation into the number of lines matching the original. The length of each line will be of a similar size.":13,"Code Escaping Algorithm":14,"Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues (not yet implemented, please wait for the future updates)":15},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/testAddon/emoji.js":{"data":[["Load Actor Reference as Glossary","액터 참조를 용어집으로 로드"],["If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.","체크하면, Translator++가 액터 참조를 용어집으로 로드합니다. 이는 번역자가 대화의 맥락을 이해하는 데 도움이 됩니다. 액터 참조는 대화에서의 액터 이름입니다. 이는 번역자에게 용어집으로 로드되어 번역 비용을 증가시킵니다."],["Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.","대화에 존재하는 캐릭터만 각 배치 항목에 대한 용어집으로 로드됩니다. 프롬프트 메시지에서 액터 참조를 로드하려면 템플릿 명령을 사용하세요."],["Actor Reference Translation Column","액터 참조 번역 열"],["The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.","액터 이름 번역의 열입니다. 이 열은 액터 참조의 번역으로 사용되어 대화에서 액터 이름 번역의 일관성을 향상시킵니다."],["Actor's Information Column","액터 정보 열"],["The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.","액터의 추가 정보를 포함하는 열입니다. 성별, 나이 등 더 많은 정보를 넣을 수 있으며, 이는 대화에서 대명사 번역을 개선합니다."],["System Message Template","시스템 메시지 템플릿"],["System message is the header of the message that will tell what is the role of your chatGPT assistant. This message will be sent as the very first message of every batch you send to chatGPT.","시스템 메시지는 ChatGPT 어시스턴트의 역할을 알리는 메시지의 헤더입니다. 이 메시지는 ChatGPT로 보내는 모든 배치의 첫 번째 메시지로 전송됩니다."],["You can include the following variables with JavaScript's Template Literal style <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>","JavaScript의 템플릿 리터럴 스타일 <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span>을 사용하여 다음 변수를 포함할 수 있습니다.<br>"],["Variables:<br>","변수:<br>"],["<li>LANG_FROM : Source language</li>","<li>LANG_FROM : 원본 언어</li>"],["<li>LANG_TO : Target language</li>","<li>LANG_TO : 대상 언어</li>"],["<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : Full source language name</li>","<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : 전체 원본 언어 이름</li>"],["<li>LANG_TO_FULL : Full target language name</li>","<li>LANG_TO_FULL : 전체 대상 언어 이름</li>"],["<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Source text</li>","<li>SOURCE_TEXT : 원본 텍스트</li>"],["<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Pre-defined message of escape algorithm.</li>","<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : 이스케이프 알고리즘의 사전 정의된 메시지.</li>"],["<li>NEWLINE_STRING : String represents new line (Line substitute).</li>","<li>NEWLINE_STRING : 줄 바꿈을 나타내는 문자열 (줄 대체).</li>"],["<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Number of messages in the batch.</li>","<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : 배치 내 메시지 수입니다.</li>"],["<li>ACTOR_INFO : Add information of the actors.</li>","<li>ACTOR_INFO : 배우들의 정보를 추가합니다.</li>"],["<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>","<li>TITLE : 게임의 제목</li>"],["<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>","<li>ENGINE : 게임의 엔진</li>"],["<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>","<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Translator++ 객체에서 참조를 생성합니다. <br />예시 : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>"],["Body Message Template","본문 메시지 템플릿"],["Template of the body of your chat.","채팅 본문의 템플릿입니다."],["Sample conversation","샘플 대화"],["The ChatGPT Batch API allows you to translate your project asynchronously at 50% lower costs, meaning you will receive the results of your translation <b style=\"color:red\">within 24 hours</b> at <b style=\"color:red\">half the normal cost</b>. This is particularly useful for large projects that do not require immediate translation results.","ChatGPT 배치 API를 사용하면 비동기적으로 프로젝트를 번역할 수 있으며, 비용이 50% 절감되어 번역 결과를 <b style=\"color:red\">24시간 이내</b>에 <b style=\"color:red\">정상 비용의 절반</b>으로 받을 수 있습니다. 이는 즉각적인 번역 결과가 필요하지 않은 대규모 프로젝트에 특히 유용합니다."],[" <br />Read more about the ChatGPT Batch API: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch ."," <br />ChatGPT 배치 API에 대해 더 알아보기: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch ."],["Glossary","용어집"],["<h2>Glossary</h2>","<h2>용어집</h2>"],["<p>You may or may not use the glossary. The glossary will be loaded for each batch items to improve the quality of the translation.</p>","<p>용어집을 사용할 수도 있고 사용하지 않을 수도 있습니다. 용어집은 번역 품질을 향상시키기 위해 각 배치 항목에 로드됩니다.</p>"],["The Column of Actor's Additional Information","배우 추가 정보의 열"],["Prompt Template","프롬프트 템플릿"],["<h2>1. System Message</h2>","<h2>1. 시스템 메시지</h2>"],["<p>Here you can explain to the assistant, what is their role.</p>","<p>여기서는 어시스턴트에게 그들의 역할이 무엇인지 설명할 수 있습니다.</p>"],["<h2>2. Sample dialogue</h2>","<h2>2. 샘플 대화</h2>"],["<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>","<p>기존 대화의 샘플입니다. 좋은 응답이나 나쁜 응답의 샘플을 작성하여 번역자가 목표와 대화의 맥락을 이해하도록 도울 수 있습니다.</p>"],["<h2>3. Your actual prompt</h2>","<h2>3. 실제 프롬프트</h2>"],["<p>This is the actual prompt to the assistant.</p>","<p>이것은 어시스턴트에게 보내는 실제 프롬프트입니다.</p>"],["<h3>Overhead cost</h3>\n                        Overhead cost is the cost of the prompt message that you send to the assistant without the actual translation texts. The cost is calculated based on the number of tokens in the prompt message. The more tokens you have, the higher the cost will be.<br>\n                        <b>Current overhead cost:</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> tokens / request.","<h3>간접 비용</h3>\n                        간접 비용은 실제 번역 텍스트 없이 어시스턴트에게 보내는 프롬프트 메시지의 비용입니다. 비용은 프롬프트 메시지의 토큰 수를 기반으로 계산됩니다. 토큰이 많을수록 비용이 높아집니다.<br>\n                        <b>현재 간접 비용:</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> 토큰 / 요청."]],"context":[["tid/1555/type/StringLiteral","tid/2095/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1565/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1572/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1606/type/StringLiteral","tid/2126/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1616/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1643/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1653/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1695/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1703/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1711/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1724/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1732/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1740/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1748/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1756/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1764/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1772/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1780/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1788/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1796/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1804/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1812/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1850/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1860/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1906/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2001/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2013/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2039/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2065/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2072/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2157/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2189/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2215/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2222/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2266/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2273/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2399/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2406/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2459/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"emoji.js","dirname":"/addons/testAddon","extension":".js","filename":"emoji.js","path":"/addons/testAddon/emoji.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Load Actor Reference as Glossary":0,"If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.":1,"Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.":2,"Actor Reference Translation Column":3,"The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.":4,"Actor's Information Column":5,"The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.":6,"System Message Template":7,"System message is the header of the message that will tell what is the role of your chatGPT assistant. This message will be sent as the very first message of every batch you send to chatGPT.":8,"You can include the following variables with JavaScript's Template Literal style <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>":9,"Variables:<br>":10,"<li>LANG_FROM : Source language</li>":11,"<li>LANG_TO : Target language</li>":12,"<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : Full source language name</li>":13,"<li>LANG_TO_FULL : Full target language name</li>":14,"<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Source text</li>":15,"<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Pre-defined message of escape algorithm.</li>":16,"<li>NEWLINE_STRING : String represents new line (Line substitute).</li>":17,"<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Number of messages in the batch.</li>":18,"<li>ACTOR_INFO : Add information of the actors.</li>":19,"<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>":20,"<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>":21,"<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>":22,"Body Message Template":23,"Template of the body of your chat.":24,"Sample conversation":25,"The ChatGPT Batch API allows you to translate your project asynchronously at 50% lower costs, meaning you will receive the results of your translation <b style=\"color:red\">within 24 hours</b> at <b style=\"color:red\">half the normal cost</b>. This is particularly useful for large projects that do not require immediate translation results.":26," <br />Read more about the ChatGPT Batch API: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch .":27,"Glossary":28,"<h2>Glossary</h2>":29,"<p>You may or may not use the glossary. The glossary will be loaded for each batch items to improve the quality of the translation.</p>":30,"The Column of Actor's Additional Information":31,"Prompt Template":32,"<h2>1. System Message</h2>":33,"<p>Here you can explain to the assistant, what is their role.</p>":34,"<h2>2. Sample dialogue</h2>":35,"<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>":36,"<h2>3. Your actual prompt</h2>":37,"<p>This is the actual prompt to the assistant.</p>":38,"<h3>Overhead cost</h3>\n                        Overhead cost is the cost of the prompt message that you send to the assistant without the actual translation texts. The cost is calculated based on the number of tokens in the prompt message. The more tokens you have, the higher the cost will be.<br>\n                        <b>Current overhead cost:</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> tokens / request.":39},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/tinyrpa/util.js":{"data":[["TinyRPA server is not installed. Do you want to install it now?","TinyRPA 서버가 설치되지 않았습니다. 지금 설치하시겠습니까?"]],"context":[["tid/854/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"util.js","dirname":"/addons/tinyrpa","extension":".js","filename":"util.js","path":"/addons/tinyrpa/util.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"TinyRPA server is not installed. Do you want to install it now?":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/tm/tm.js":{"data":[["Automatic organic translation memorization","자동 유기적 번역 기억"],["If checked, all organic translation (manually inputted translation) will be memorized automatically.","체크하면, 모든 유기적 번역(수동 입력된 번역)이 자동으로 기억됩니다."],["Memorize translation by automation script","자동화 스크립트로 번역 기억"],["If checked, Translator++ will remember the translation created from automation scripts. \nAll changes via 'this.cells' will be memorized. But it is possible for us to modify the contents of the grid directly using the trans API, such changes will not trigger the automatic memorization.","체크하면, Translator++는 자동화 스크립트에서 생성된 번역을 기억합니다.\n'this.cells'를 통한 모든 변경 사항이 기억됩니다. 하지만 trans API를 사용하여 그리드 내용을 직접 수정할 수 있으며, 이러한 변경은 자동 기억을 트리거하지 않습니다."],["Remind translation on cell translate","셀 번역 시 번역 알림"],["If checked, Translator++ will load translation from translation memory first before performing automatic translation on selected cell.","체크하면, Translator++는 선택된 셀에 자동 번역을 수행하기 전에 번역 메모리에서 먼저 번역을 로드합니다."],["Default memorization behavior","기본 기억 동작"],["Overwrite previous record when performing organic translation. If unchecked, TM will not memorize the new translation for existing record.","유기적 번역 수행 시 이전 기록을 덮어씁니다. 체크 해제하면, TM은 기존 기록에 대한 새 번역을 기억하지 않습니다."],["MySQL host","MySQL 호스트"],["The host name or IP address of your MySQL server","MySQL 서버의 호스트 이름 또는 IP 주소"],["MySQL port","MySQL 포트"],["MySQL Port. Default is 3306.","MySQL 포트. 기본값은 3306입니다."],["MySQL user name","MySQL 사용자 이름"],["Username to access the DB.","DB에 접근하기 위한 사용자 이름"],["MySQL password","MySQL 비밀번호"],["Password to access the DB.","DB에 접근하기 위한 비밀번호"],["Database Name","데이터베이스 이름"],["Database name. Translator++ will try to create database if not exist. But the success is depend on the privilege of the given credential.","데이터베이스 이름. Translator++는 존재하지 않을 경우 데이터베이스를 생성하려고 시도합니다. 하지만 성공 여부는 제공된 자격 증명의 권한에 따라 달라집니다."],["Database Type","데이터베이스 유형"],["Automatically memorize manually inputted translations?","수동으로 입력된 번역을 자동으로 기억하시겠습니까?"],["Sorry, this addon is only available for active patrons only.\nYou can unlock this feature by becoming a $1 patron.","죄송합니다, 이 애드온은 활성 후원자에게만 제공됩니다.\n이 기능을 잠금 해제하려면 $1 후원자가 되세요."],["Automatically memorize translation made by automation scripts?","자동화 스크립트로 생성된 번역을 자동으로 기억하시겠습니까?"],["Remind translations when performing translate selection?","선택 번역 수행 시 번역을 다시 알리시겠습니까?"],["Use rememorize in organic translation","유기적 번역에서 재기억 사용"],["default","기본값"],["Indexed DB (experimental)","인덱스된 DB (실험적)"],["MySQL","MySQL"],["Database Setting","데이터베이스 설정"],["IndexedDB","IndexedDB"],["Generate","생성"],["Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues","대화 내 인라인 코드에 대한 이스케이프 알고리즘"],["Test connection","연결 테스트"],["Connection success!","연결 성공!"],["MySql","MySQL"],["Connection failed!\nError:","연결 실패!\n오류:"],["Install MySQL Server","MySQL 서버 설치"],["How to setup MySQL Server","MySQL 서버 설정 방법"],["Multiple translations for one key sentence is detected.\nOnly the last found translation will be memorized by the Translation Memory.\nDo you want to continue?","하나의 키 문장에 대해 여러 번역이 감지되었습니다.\n번역 메모리는 마지막으로 발견된 번역만 기억합니다.\n계속하시겠습니까?"],["Your database structure need to be updated.","데이터베이스 구조를 업데이트해야 합니다."],["Upgrade database","데이터베이스 업그레이드"],["This action will upgrade your database.\nDo you want to upgrade your translation memory database?","이 작업은 데이터베이스를 업그레이드합니다.\n번역 메모리 데이터베이스를 업그레이드하시겠습니까?"],["The translation memory database has been upgraded!\nPlease restart Translator++!","번역 메모리 데이터베이스가 업그레이드되었습니다!\nTranslator++를 다시 시작해 주세요!"]],"context":[["tid/292/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/302/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/340/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/350/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/388/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/398/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/436/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/446/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/484/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/494/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/532/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/588/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/598/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/643/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/653/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/698/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/708/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/754/type/StringLiteral","tid/764/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/835/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/878/type/StringLiteral","tid/1008/type/StringLiteral","tid/1138/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/965/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1095/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1225/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1290/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1300/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1310/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1390/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1428/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1459/type/StringLiteral","tid/1938/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1469/type/StringLiteral","tid/1948/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1500/type/StringLiteral","tid/1979/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1523/type/StringLiteral","tid/2093/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1557/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2114/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2153/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2201/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3362/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4084/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4095/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4123/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4203/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"tm.js","dirname":"/addons/tm","extension":".js","filename":"tm.js","path":"/addons/tm/tm.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Automatic organic translation memorization":0,"If checked, all organic translation (manually inputted translation) will be memorized automatically.":1,"Memorize translation by automation script":2,"If checked, Translator++ will remember the translation created from automation scripts. \nAll changes via 'this.cells' will be memorized. But it is possible for us to modify the contents of the grid directly using the trans API, such changes will not trigger the automatic memorization.":3,"Remind translation on cell translate":4,"If checked, Translator++ will load translation from translation memory first before performing automatic translation on selected cell.":5,"Default memorization behavior":6,"Overwrite previous record when performing organic translation. If unchecked, TM will not memorize the new translation for existing record.":7,"MySQL host":8,"The host name or IP address of your MySQL server":9,"MySQL port":10,"MySQL Port. Default is 3306.":11,"MySQL user name":12,"Username to access the DB.":13,"MySQL password":14,"Password to access the DB.":15,"Database Name":16,"Database name. Translator++ will try to create database if not exist. But the success is depend on the privilege of the given credential.":17,"Database Type":18,"Automatically memorize manually inputted translations?":19,"Sorry, this addon is only available for active patrons only.\nYou can unlock this feature by becoming a $1 patron.":20,"Automatically memorize translation made by automation scripts?":21,"Remind translations when performing translate selection?":22,"Use rememorize in organic translation":23,"default":24,"Indexed DB (experimental)":25,"MySQL":26,"Database Setting":27,"IndexedDB":28,"Generate":29,"Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues":30,"Test connection":31,"Connection success!":32,"MySql":33,"Connection failed!\nError:":34,"Install MySQL Server":35,"How to setup MySQL Server":36,"Multiple translations for one key sentence is detected.\nOnly the last found translation will be memorized by the Translation Memory.\nDo you want to continue?":37,"Your database structure need to be updated.":38,"Upgrade database":39,"This action will upgrade your database.\nDo you want to upgrade your translation memory database?":40,"The translation memory database has been upgraded!\nPlease restart Translator++!":41},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/tm/tmUI.js":{"data":[["Memory","메모리"],["Fix the problem!","문제를 해결하세요!"],["No exact matches found!","정확한 일치 항목을 찾을 수 없습니다!"],["Original","원문"],["Translation","번역"],["Do you want Translator++ to forget the selected cell(s)?","Translator++가 선택된 셀을 잊게 하시겠습니까?"],["Auto recall","자동 회상"],["Auto memorize organic translation","유기적 번역 자동 기억"],["Auto memorize automation","자동화 자동 기억"],["Use rememorize in organic translation","유기적 번역에서 재기억 사용"]],"context":[["tid/47/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/534/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/591/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1126/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1131/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1804/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2391/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2543/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2686/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2838/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"tmUI.js","dirname":"/addons/tm","extension":".js","filename":"tmUI.js","path":"/addons/tm/tmUI.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Memory":0,"Fix the problem!":1,"No exact matches found!":2,"Original":3,"Translation":4,"Do you want Translator++ to forget the selected cell(s)?":5,"Auto recall":6,"Auto memorize organic translation":7,"Auto memorize automation":8,"Use rememorize in organic translation":9},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/tpp-localizationTool/fetchtrans.js":{"data":[["Preparing download file...","다운로드 파일 준비 중..."],["Translation template downloaded successfully!","번역 템플릿이 성공적으로 다운로드되었습니다!"],["Building translation data...","번역 데이터 구축 중..."],["Processing: ","처리 중: "],["Fetching directory content...","디렉토리 내용 가져오는 중..."],["Parsing: ","파싱: "],["Localization Tools"],["Generate UI Translation Template"],["Update Translation Table"],["This will overwrite www/lang/template.trans and update all localization files listed in www/lang/options.json.\n\nExisting translations will be preserved. New strings from the current source will be added.\n\nContinue?"],["Saving template.trans..."],["Loading language options..."],["Updating: "],["Failed to update: "],["Translation tables updated successfully!"]],"context":[["tid/2001/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2228/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2286/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2439/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2623/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2825/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3098/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3131/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3208/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3244/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3358/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3402/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3651/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3800/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3840/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"fetchtrans.js","dirname":"/addons/tpp-localizationTool","extension":".js","filename":"fetchtrans.js","path":"/addons/tpp-localizationTool/fetchtrans.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Preparing download file...":0,"Translation template downloaded successfully!":1,"Building translation data...":2,"Processing: ":3,"Fetching directory content...":4,"Parsing: ":5,"Localization Tools":6,"Generate UI Translation Template":7,"Update Translation Table":8,"This will overwrite www/lang/template.trans and update all localization files listed in www/lang/options.json.\n\nExisting translations will be preserved. New strings from the current source will be added.\n\nContinue?":9,"Saving template.trans...":10,"Loading language options...":11,"Updating: ":12,"Failed to update: ":13,"Translation tables updated successfully!":14},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/transChatGPT/BetterChatGPT/dist/assets/index-05e7d66a.js":{"data":[["customModels.customLabel","사용자 정의 모델.사용자 정의 레이블"],["model","모델"],["|","|"],["promptLibrary","프롬프트 라이브러리"],["search","검색"],["downloadChat","채팅 다운로드"],["newChat","새 채팅"],["api","API"],["customEndpoint","사용자 정의 엔드포인트"],["apiEndpoint.inputLabel","API 엔드포인트.입력 레이블"],["apiKey.inputLabel","API 키.입력 레이블"],["apiVersion.inputLabel","API 버전.입력 레이블"],["apiVersion.description","API 버전.설명"],["securityMessage","보안 메시지"],["apiEndpoint.description","API 엔드포인트.설명"],["apiEndpoint.warn","API 엔드포인트.경고"],["partialImportMessages","부분 가져오기 메시지"],["import","가져오기"],["name","이름"],["prompt","프롬프트"],["clearPrompts","프롬프트 지우기"],["morePrompts","더 많은 프롬프트"],["toast.sync","토스트.동기화"],["toast.stop","토스트.중지"],["button.sync","버튼.동기화"],["button.stop","버튼.중지"]],"context":[["tid/100988/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/100993/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/461961/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/553437/type/StringLiteral","tid/622216/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/553469/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/557612/type/StringLiteral","tid/557632/type/StringLiteral","tid/557654/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/560505/type/StringLiteral","tid/560543/type/StringLiteral","tid/560586/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606465/type/StringLiteral","tid/606538/type/StringLiteral","tid/606579/type/StringLiteral","tid/606677/type/StringLiteral","tid/606756/type/StringLiteral","tid/606782/type/StringLiteral","tid/606903/type/StringLiteral","tid/606925/type/StringLiteral","tid/606947/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606533/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606574/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606672/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606751/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606777/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606898/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606920/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/606942/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/608789/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/608794/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/622327/type/StringLiteral","tid/630226/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/622347/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/622664/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/622687/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/629607/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/629731/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/629782/type/StringLiteral","tid/629789/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/629815/type/StringLiteral","tid/629822/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"index-05e7d66a.js","dirname":"/addons/transChatGPT/BetterChatGPT/dist/assets","extension":".js","filename":"index-05e7d66a.js","path":"/addons/transChatGPT/BetterChatGPT/dist/assets/index-05e7d66a.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"customModels.customLa